# translated-by: libretranslate
#, python-brace-format
msgid "**Do not alert on ``vault_core_unsealed``.** OpenBao keeps Vault’s metric namespace, and a healthy unsealed node emits ``vault_core_unsealed{cluster=\"\"} 0``, so an alert on ``== 0`` fires permanently. Use ``/v1/sys/health`` (503 while sealed); ``vault_core_active{cluster=\"…\"} == 1`` corroborates."
msgstr "**Nevšímajte si ``vault_core_unsealed``.** OpenBao udržuje Vault ``vault_core_unsealed{cluster=\"\"} 0``, takže upozornenie na ``== 0`` požiare natrvalo. Použitie ``/v1/sys/health`` (503 zatiaľ čo zapečatené); ``vault_core_active{cluster=\"…\"} == 1`` potvrdzuje."

# translated-by: libretranslate
#, python-brace-format
msgid "**Do not alert on `vault_core_unsealed`.** OpenBao keeps Vault's metric namespace, and a healthy unsealed node emits `vault_core_unsealed{cluster=\"\"} 0`, so an alert on `== 0` fires permanently. Use `/v1/sys/health` (503 while sealed); `vault_core_active{cluster=\"…\"} == 1` corroborates."
msgstr "**Nevšímajte si `vault_core_unsealed`.** OpenBao udržuje Vault v metrickom menovom priestore, a zdravý neuzavretý uzol emituje `vault_core_unsealed{cluster=\"\"} 0`, takže upozornenie na `== 0` požiare natrvalo. Použitie `/v1/sys/health` (503 zatiaľ čo zapečatené); `vault_core_active{cluster=\"…\"} == 1` potvrdzuje."

