# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Eligibility is read from LiteLLM's own catalog; a declaration is the override.** The image ships `model_prices_and_context_window_backup.json`, 1595 models deep, carrying `max_input_tokens`, `supports_vision`, `supports_function_calling` and `input_cost_per_token`. The hook reads a route's capabilities from `litellm.model_cost`, keyed on the route's own `litellm_params.model` and then on that name without its first segment, because `ollama/llama3` is filed prefixed while `openai/gpt-4o-mini` is filed as `gpt-4o-mini`. It never probes a backend at request time."
msgstr "**Oprávnenosť sa číta z vlastného katalógu LiteLLM; vyhlásenie je prepis.** Obrazové lode `model_prices_and_context_window_backup.json`, 1595 modely hlboké, nosenie `max_input_tokens`, `supports_vision`, `supports_function_calling` a `input_cost_per_token`. Háčik číta možnosti trasy od `litellm.model_cost`, keyed on the route's own `litellm_params.model` a potom na tomto mene bez jeho prvého segmentu, pretože `ollama/llama3` je podaná predpona počas `openai/gpt-4o-mini` sa podáva ako `gpt-4o-mini`. Nikdy nesonduje backend na požiadanie."

