# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Keycloak sign-in:** With Keycloak in the deployment, the role sets ``services.sso.flavor: oidc`` and the LiteLLM Gateway reads the platform’s OIDC endpoints from ``GENERIC_CLIENT_ID``, ``GENERIC_CLIENT_SECRET``, ``GENERIC_AUTHORIZATION_ENDPOINT``, ``GENERIC_TOKEN_ENDPOINT`` and ``GENERIC_USERINFO_ENDPOINT``. Sign in at ``/sso/key/generate``; ``PROXY_ADMIN_ID`` carries the administrator’s username. LiteLLM serves SSO for up to five accounts in ``litellm_usertable`` and refuses beyond that without ``LITELLM_LICENSE``."
msgstr "**Prihlásenie Keycloak:** s Keycloak pri rozmiestnení sa stanovuje úloha, ``services.sso.flavor: oidc`` a LiteLLM Gateway číta parametre OIDC platformy od ``GENERIC_CLIENT_ID``, ``GENERIC_CLIENT_SECRET``, ``GENERIC_AUTHORIZATION_ENDPOINT``, ``GENERIC_TOKEN_ENDPOINT`` a ``GENERIC_USERINFO_ENDPOINT``. Prihláste sa na ``/sso/key/generate``; ``PROXY_ADMIN_ID`` nesie meno užívateľa správcu. LiteLLM slúži SSO až pre päť účtov v ``litellm_usertable`` a odmieta nad rámec toho bez ``LITELLM_LICENSE``."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Keycloak sign-in:** With Keycloak in the deployment, the role sets `services.sso.flavor: oidc` and the LiteLLM Gateway reads the platform's OIDC endpoints from `GENERIC_CLIENT_ID`, `GENERIC_CLIENT_SECRET`, `GENERIC_AUTHORIZATION_ENDPOINT`, `GENERIC_TOKEN_ENDPOINT` and `GENERIC_USERINFO_ENDPOINT`. Sign in at `/sso/key/generate`; `PROXY_ADMIN_ID` carries the administrator's username. LiteLLM serves SSO for up to five accounts in `litellm_usertable` and refuses beyond that without `LITELLM_LICENSE`."
msgstr "**Prihlásenie Keycloak:** s Keycloak pri rozmiestnení sa stanovuje úloha, `services.sso.flavor: oidc` a LiteLLM Gateway číta parametre OIDC platformy z `GENERIC_CLIENT_ID`, `GENERIC_CLIENT_SECRET`, `GENERIC_AUTHORIZATION_ENDPOINT`, `GENERIC_TOKEN_ENDPOINT` a `GENERIC_USERINFO_ENDPOINT`. Prihláste sa na `/sso/key/generate`; `PROXY_ADMIN_ID` nesie užívateľské meno správcu. LiteLLM slúži SSO až pre päť účtov v `litellm_usertable` a odmieta nad rámec toho bez `LITELLM_LICENSE`."

