msgstr "**Propagácia životného cyklu:** *web-app-checkmk*, *web-app-jellyfin*, *web-app-n8n*, *svc-registry-docker* a *svc-registry-cache* vopred *beta*."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Lifecycle settings:** ``agents.idle_stop``, ``agents.idle_minutes``, ``agents.max_running``, ``agents.start_timeout`` and ``agents.access_cache_seconds`` in ``meta/services.yml`` control idle stops, the running-agent bound, the start wait and the membership cache; an inventory overrides them under ``applications.svc-ai-agent-broker.services.agent-broker.agents``. An agent serving a request is never swept."
msgstr "**Nastavenie životného cyklu:** ``agents.idle_stop``, ``agents.idle_minutes``, ``agents.max_running``, ``agents.start_timeout`` a ``agents.access_cache_seconds`` on ``meta/services.yml`` ovládanie zastávok voľnobehu, viazanie bežiaceho agenta, čakanie na štart a vyrovnávacia pamäť členstva; inventár ich prepíše pod ``applications.svc-ai-agent-broker.services.agent-broker.agents``. Agent, ktorý slúži na žiadosť, nie je nikdy zametený."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Lifecycle settings:** `agents.idle_stop`, `agents.idle_minutes`, `agents.max_running`, `agents.start_timeout` and `agents.access_cache_seconds` in `meta/services.yml` control idle stops, the running-agent bound, the start wait and the membership cache; an inventory overrides them under `applications.svc-ai-agent-broker.services.agent-broker.agents`. An agent serving a request is never swept."
