# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Remote providers:** OpenAI, Anthropic and OpenRouter each add their models when a key is configured. The keys are declared in ``meta/secrets.yml`` with the ``type`` and ``regex`` their value must satisfy, and default to the central ``API.<provider>.api_key`` entry; an unset key leaves that provider’s routes unpublished."
msgstr "**Vzdialení poskytovatelia:** OpenAI, Antropic a OpenRouter každý pridá svoje modely, keď je nakonfigurovaný kľúč. Kľúče sú deklarované v ``meta/secrets.yml`` s ``type`` a ``regex`` ich hodnota musí spĺňať a predvolená ústrednému ``API.<provider>.api_key`` vstup; deset kľúč opustí, že provider sa trasy neuverejnené."

