# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**[Hermes Agent](https://hermes-agent.nousresearch.com/)** (Nous Research, MIT). Self-hostable with `local`, `Docker`, `SSH`, `Singularity`, `Modal` backends plus container hardening. Ships an official web dashboard with **self-hosted OIDC** auth (fits the platform SSO), delegates work through **isolated subagents**, has persistent memory, scheduling, vision web browsing, and MCP support (**client since v0.2.0, server since v0.6.0**). Deployed as `web-app-hermes`."
msgstr "**[Agent Hermes.](https://hermes-agent.nousresearch.com/)** (Nous Research, MIT). Samoobsluha s `local`, `Docker`, `SSH`, `Singularity`, `Modal` backendy plus kalenie kontajnera. Lode oficiálnej webovej prístrojovej dosky s **OIDC** auth (zodpovedá platforme SSO), delegáti pracujú cez **izolované subagenty**, má trvalé pamäte, plánovanie, vízie web prehliadanie, a MCP podporu (**klient od v0.2.0, server od v0.6.0**)@ info: whatsthis `web-app-hermes`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**[OpenClaw](https://openclaw.ai/)** (open-source, npm/pnpm). Built-in Gateway web dashboard (default port `18789`) plus CLI/TUI, browser control, filesystem sandbox, persistent memory, skills/plugins, and native MCP (`@modelcontextprotocol/sdk`, both client and server). Deployed as `web-app-openclaw`."
msgstr "**[OpenClaw](https://openclaw.ai/)** (open-source, npm/pnpm). Vstavaná palubovka Gateway (štandardný port `18789`) plus CLI/TUI, riadenie prehliadača, filesystem sandbox, trvalá pamäť, zručnosti/pluginy a natívne MCP (`@modelcontextprotocol/sdk`, klient aj server)@ info: whatsthis `web-app-openclaw`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**`--full-cycle` (async update pass).** When set (or `full_cycle=true` on `make compose-deploy`), the wrapper runs each round's deploy TWICE: first the regular sync pass, then immediately a second pass with `-e ASYNC_ENABLED=true` overriding the host_var, against the SAME variant's folder, BEFORE moving to the next round. The two passes are therefore always co-located on the same host state; the async pass never accidentally targets a host that a previous round's variant left behind."
msgstr "**`--full-cycle` (Async aktualizácia priechod).** Pri nastavení (alebo `full_cycle=true` o `make compose-deploy`), obal beží každé kolo je nasadiť TWICE: najprv pravidelná synchronizácia priechod, potom okamžite druhý priechod s `-e ASYNC_ENABLED=true` Prekročenie hranice host_var, proti priečinku SAME variantu, Pred presunom do ďalšieho kola. Tieto dva pasy sú preto vždy umiestnené v rovnakom hostiteľskom štáte; async nikdy náhodne nezameriava hostiteľa, ktorého variant predchádzajúceho kola zanechal za sebou."

# translated-by: libretranslate
