# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "A Playwright scenario asserts that an unauthenticated request to the endpoint is never answered with a 2xx."
msgstr "Scenár Playwright tvrdí, že neautorizovaná požiadavka na koncový bod nie je nikdy zodpovedaná 2xx."

