# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Admission is not declared here. A client marks itself once, in its own ``meta/services.yml`` self-entry, as ``mcp_consumer: true``; a provider deviates by carrying ``mcp_consumer: false`` on that client's entry in its own ``meta/services.yml``. ``derive_allowed_consumers`` resolves the pair."
msgstr "Vstup nie je tu deklarovaný. Klient sa raz označkoval, vo svojom vlastnom ``meta/services.yml`` vlastný vstup ako ``mcp_consumer: true``; poskytovateľ sa odchyľuje nosením ``mcp_consumer: false`` o vstupe tohto klienta do vlastného ``meta/services.yml``. ``derive_allowed_consumers`` vyrieši pár."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Admission lives in `meta/services.yml`, not here. A client sets `services.<own-entity>.mcp_consumer: true` in its own role; a provider refuses one by setting `mcp_consumer: false` on that client's entry. [`test_mcp_consumer_services_entry.py`](../../../../../tests/lint/ansible/services/test_mcp_consumer_services_entry.py) requires every provider to carry a `\"{{ '<client>' in group_names }}\"`-gated entry for every declared client, so a round plans provider and client together."
msgstr "Vstupné životy v `meta/services.yml`, Nie tu. Súbory klientov `services.<own-entity>.mcp_consumer: true` vo svojej vlastnej úlohe; poskytovateľ ho odmietne nastaviť `mcp_consumer: false` pri vstupe toho klienta. [`test_mcp_consumer_services_entry.py`](../../../../../tests/lint/ansible/services/test_mcp_consumer_services_entry.py) vyžaduje, aby každý poskytovateľ nosil `\"{{ '<client>' in group_names }}\"`-prehlásil vstup pre každého deklarovaného klienta, takže round plán poskytovateľa a klienta spolu."

