msgstr "Najlepší výkon: beh \"pytón -m <module> --help\" a extrahujú prvý odsek po použití."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Best-effort: the puppeteer browser is not downloaded here (``PUPPETEER_SKIP_DOWNLOAD``) so ``install-lint`` stays sandbox-safe. mmdc only needs a browser to RENDER, which ``scripts/lint/mermaid.sh`` provisions on demand (``npx puppeteer browsers install chrome-headless-shell``) right before it renders. That browser ships as a zip, so ``unzip`` is ensured here (puppeteer's extractor needs it, else it leaves an empty version dir and mmdc reports the browser missing). A failed install warns instead of aborting ``install-lint``, so sandboxes without npm/browser access still get the rest of the lint toolchain."
msgstr "Best-efort: tu nie je stiahnutý prehliadač bábkarov (``PUPPETEER_SKIP_DOWNLOAD``) Takže... ``install-lint`` zostáva v bezpečí. mmdc potrebuje iba prehliadač, ktorý ``scripts/lint/mermaid.sh`` ustanovenia o dopyte (``npx puppeteer browsers install chrome-headless-shell``) tesne pred tým, ako to urobí. Ten prehliadač pláva ako zips, takže ``unzip`` tu je zabezpečená (bábkarov extraktor ho potrebuje, inak zanechá prázdne verzie dir a mmdc hlási chýba prehliadač). Zlyhaná inštalácia varuje miesto prerušenia ``install-lint``, takže pieskoviská bez Npm / prehliadač prístup stále dostať zvyšok lint toolchain."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Better ideas can arrive late."
