# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Cap torch's intra-op threads on the CPU path. `meta/services.yml` limits the container to `cpus: \"2.0\"`, but torch sizes its thread pool from the host's core count, so a 16-core runner spawns 16 threads for 2 cores. laya reads `LAYA_THREADS` (`serve.py`, `_apply_thread_limit`) and upstream says to keep it at or below the physical core count; `templates/env.j2` does not set it. Costs latency, breaks nothing, so no test catches it."
msgstr "Vnútorná niť pochodne na ceste procesora. `meta/services.yml` obmedzuje nádobu na `cpus: \"2.0\"`, ale pochodeň veľkosť nite bazén z hostiteľovho jadra, takže 16-core runner spawns 16 nite pre 2 jadra. číta `LAYA_THREADS` (`serve.py`, `_apply_thread_limit`) a proti prúdu hovorí, aby to na alebo pod fyzickým jadra počet; `templates/env.j2` nenastavuje to. Náklady na latenciu, nič neporuší, takže žiaden test ho nechytí."

