# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Daniel Kahneman's split names the shape. The models behind the gateway are System II: slow, general, token-generating. What is missing is System I: fast, typed, no generation, deciding which System II model answers. TypeSafe released [Jev](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Jev_(AI_model)) on 2026-09-15 as a model of exactly that kind, and [jev-router](https://github.com/prismhq/jev-router) wires one into LiteLLM as a pre-call hook. This requirement takes that shape and keeps the decision deterministic; decision 8 records why."
msgstr "Daniel Kahneman si rozdelil tvar. Modelmi za bránou sú systém II: pomalý, všeobecný, žetón generujúci. Chýba systém I: rýchle, zadané, žiadne generovanie, rozhodovanie o tom, ktorý model systému II odpovedá. TypSafe prepustený [Jev](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Jev_(AI_model)) o 2026-09-15 ako model presne takého druhu a [jev-router](https://github.com/prismhq/jev-router) Prepojíme jednu do LiteLLM ako predvolací hák. Táto požiadavka má tento tvar a udržuje rozhodnutie rozhodujúce; rozhodnutie 8 nahráva prečo."

