msgstr "Smer"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Direction gates the wiring: a `server` role only exposes `/mcp`, a `client` role only consumes, a `both` role does either. Implementation precedence is `native > plugin > sidecar > external`; a `sidecar`/`external` server gets its own service entry and port rather than reusing the app's primary HTTP port."
msgstr "Smerové brány vedenia: a `server` len odhalenia úlohy `/mcp`, a `client` úloha len spotrebuje, a `both` Ani jedna rola. Priorita implementácie je `native > plugin > sidecar > external`; a `sidecar`/`external` server dostane svoj vlastný servisný vstup a port namiesto opätovného použitia primárneho HTTP portu aplikácie."

