# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Dive into a world of rhythm and sound with [Funkwhale](https://www.funkwhale.audio/), an innovative self-hosted music sharing platform that celebrates creativity and community. Experience an energetic soundscape and seamless music streaming that amplifies your passion for tunes."
