# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Drive that whole sequence on compose, then re-run it on swarm before claiming any criterion done. Use `lookup('container_address', ...)` from the first init task rather than retro-fitting it — a compose-only `container exec <name>` works locally and then fails on every swarm task, which is the expensive way to discover Decision #11."
msgstr "Riadiť celú sekvenciu na kompozícii, potom ju znovu spustiť na roj, než si nárokovať akékoľvek kritérium urobil. Použitie `lookup('container_address', ...)` od prvej init úlohy, a nie retro-fit to `container exec <name>` pracuje lokálne a potom zlyhá na každom roji úlohu, čo je drahý spôsob, ako objaviť rozhodnutie #11."

# translated-by: libretranslate
