msgid "Each candidate starts with three to five named read tools rather than a generated copy of an API, and the first investigation uses the starter contract recorded in [Adapter starter contracts](#adapter-starter-contracts). If the exact pinned version cannot implement the named contract through a stable authenticated API, the role becomes `blocked` with the observed reason rather than receiving a generic substitute."
