msgid "Expected HTTP codes for health check (405 because Fider returns 405 on HEAD requests to ``/``)"
msgstr "Očakávané kódy HTTP na kontrolu stavu (405 pretože Fider vracia 405 o žiadostiach hláv o ``/``)"

