# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Fork [rpardini/docker-registry-proxy](https://github.com/rpardini/docker-registry-proxy) and teach the bundled nginx to handle GCP Artifact Registry redirect URLs (`/artifacts-downloads/namespaces/<ns>/repositories/<repo>/downloads/<token>`). Currently `gcr.io` blob pulls are bypassed via `NO_PROXY=…,gcr.io,storage.googleapis.com,googleusercontent.com` in [compose/registry-cache/proxy.conf](compose/registry-cache/proxy.conf), which is a workaround that disables caching for those registries. Long-term: rebase upstream's `proxy.conf` / `sub_filter` rules to recognise the new redirect shape, ship the fix in our fork, point `compose/registry-cache/Dockerfile` (or its image tag) at the fork, and drop the `NO_PROXY` bypass."
msgstr "Vidlica [rpardini/docker-registry-proxy](https://github.com/rpardini/docker-registry-proxy) a naučiť zviazané nginx zvládnuť GCP Artefact Registry presmerovanie URL (`/artifacts-downloads/namespaces/<ns>/repositories/<repo>/downloads/<token>`)V súčasnosti. `gcr.io` Blbé ťahy sú obídené cez `NO_PROXY=…,gcr.io,storage.googleapis.com,googleusercontent.com` on [compose/registry-cache/proxy.conf](compose/registry-cache/proxy.conf), čo je práca, ktorá znemožňuje caching pre tieto registre. Dlhodobé: rebase upstream `proxy.conf` / `sub_filter` pravidlá na rozoznanie nového presmerovacieho tvaru, loď opravy v našej vidličke, bod `compose/registry-cache/Dockerfile` (alebo jeho obrazový štítok) na vidličku, a drop `NO_PROXY` bypass."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Fork `pull_request` runs always receive a read-only token (GitHub-enforced); the label never grants write tokens or secrets to the untrusted event."
msgstr "Vidlica `pull_request` beží vždy dostane len na čítanie token (Posilnený GitHub); značka nikdy udeľuje napísať žetóny alebo tajomstvá nedôveryhodnej udalosti."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Fork main-branch sync: the push entry workflow now synchronizes the current repository's *main* from a configured source repository (default *infinito-nexus/core*) before CI scope and deploy discovery run, so a fork branch push sees only its own changes against an up-to-date base. The source is overridable or disablable through the *CI_SYNC_MAIN_SOURCE_REPOSITORY* repository variable, and the sync force-overwrites *main*, so a synced repository must not be used as a working branch. See [the Actions configuration reference](docs/contributing/tools/github/actions/configuration.md)."
msgstr "Vidlica hlavné-branch synchronizácia: push entry workflow teraz synchronizuje aktuálne úložisko *hlavná* z nakonfigurovaného úložiska zdrojov (štandardná *infinito-nexus/core*) pred rozsahom CI a rozmiestniť objav beží, takže vidlicová vetva push vidí len svoje vlastné zmeny proti up-to-date základne. Zdroj je cez *CI_SYNC_MAIN_SOURCE_REPOSITORY* premenná úložiska a synchronizácia prepisov *hlavná*, takže synchronizovaný úložisko nesmie byť použitý ako pracovná vetva. Pozri [Referenčné usporiadanie akcií](docs/contributing/tools/github/actions/configuration.md)."

