# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "New packaging lint: a *lint-packages* check, wired into *make lint* and its own CI workflow, validates the generated *debian/changelog* with *dpkg-parsechangelog*, the Fedora spec with *rpmspec* and the Arch *PKGBUILD* with a *bash -n* syntax pass, failing on any parser warning rather than only on a non-zero exit. A complementary *test-lint* check asserts that both package changelogs list every released version and that their inline window matches CHANGELOG.md. See [the workflow catalog](docs/contributing/tools/github/actions/workflows.md)."
msgstr "Nové obaly: a *Lint-packages* check, napojený na *make lint* a jeho vlastný pracovný postup CI potvrdzuje generovaný *debian/changelog* s *dpkg-parsechangelog*, Fedora špecifikácia s *rpmspec* a oblúk *PKGBUILD* s *bash-n* syntaxe pass, zlyhanie na akékoľvek varovanie parser skôr než len na non-nula výstupu. Doplnková *test-lint* check tvrdí, že oba balíky changelogs zoznam každej uverejnenej verzie a že ich inline okno zodpovedá CHANGELOG.md. Pozri [katalóg pracovných postupov](docs/contributing/tools/github/actions/workflows.md)."

