msgid "No ``__all__``: declaring the re-exported name makes autodoc document the class here as well as where it is defined, and sphinx then finds two targets for every ``ImageRef`` annotation."
msgstr "Nie. ``__all__``: vyhlásenie re-exportovaný názov robí autodoc dokument trieda tu, rovnako ako tam, kde je definovaná, a sfinga potom nájde dva ciele pre každý ``ImageRef`` poznámka."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "No `git commit` until every Acceptance Criterion is checked."
msgstr "Nie. `git commit` dovtedy, kým sa neskontroluje každé kritérium prijateľnosti."

# translated-by: libretranslate
