msgstr "Vlastné `_USERS_DEFAULTS_CACHE` a `_MERGED_USERS_CACHE`. Verejné API: `get_user_defaults`, `get_merged_users`. Ansibly-facing `users` Comment `get_merged_users` priamo z tohto modulu (`from utils.cache.users import get_merged_users`)."

