# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Passing ``inventory_groups`` (the ``groups`` magic variable) drops the roles no host in the inventory carries, so they never enter the loop at all. That list is identical on every host, which is the whole point: 8aea5a9b35 measured that a per-host condition above the loop makes ansible insert blocks in host order rather than loop order, after which svc-storage-nfs-client mounted an export svc-storage-nfs-server had not deployed yet. Narrowing to a single host stays in the body's ``when``, never here."
msgstr "Prechod ``inventory_groups`` (EÚ ``groups`` magická premenná) drops úlohy žiadny hostiteľ v inventári nesie, takže nikdy vstúpiť slučku vôbec. Tento zoznam je rovnaký u každého hostiteľa, čo je celý bod: 8aea5a9b35 meral, že na-host stav nad slučkou robí ansible vložka bloky v poradí hostiteľa skôr ako slučka poradie, po ktorom svc-storage-nfs-client zabudovaný export svc-storage-nfs-server ešte nebol nasadený. Zúženie na jediného hostiteľa zostane v tele ``when``, nikdy tu."

