# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Provisioning runs in ``tasks/utils/mcp.yml``: it copies the plugin into the code volume, runs ``admin/cli/upgrade.php``, enables ``enablewebservices``, appends ``mcp`` to ``webserviceprotocols``, creates the ``infinito_mcp`` external service, attaches the read-only functions, mints the permanent token and stores it under ``users.administrator.tokens['web-app-moodle']``."
msgstr "Poskytovanie beží ``tasks/utils/mcp.yml``: skopíruje plugin do objemu kódu, spustí ``admin/cli/upgrade.php``, umožňuje ``enablewebservices``, doplnky ``mcp`` do ``webserviceprotocols``, vytvára ``infinito_mcp`` externá služba, pripevňuje funkcie iba na čítanie, mentuje stály token a ukladá ho pod ``users.administrator.tokens['web-app-moodle']``."

