msgstr "Spustiť `make compose-deploy mode=reinstall apps=web-app-matrix full_cycle=true variant=0`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Run `make compose-playwright role=<role> keep=true`. You MAY pass `pw=\"--grep <pattern>\"` (or any other `npx playwright test` argument). Set `keep=true` on every inner-loop run regardless of the previous result; omit only when the user has explicitly opted out. For the full propagation chain see [Playwright Tests](../../../contributing/actions/testing/playwright.md#artefact-retention-)."
msgstr "Spustiť `make compose-playwright role=<role> keep=true`. Môžeš prejsť. `pw=\"--grep <pattern>\"` (alebo iné `npx playwright test` argument). Nastaviť `keep=true` pri každom spustení vnútornej slučky bez ohľadu na predchádzajúci výsledok; vynechať iba vtedy, keď sa používateľ výslovne zvolil. Pre celý reťazec šírenia pozri [Testy Playwrighta](../../../contributing/actions/testing/playwright.md#artefact-retention-)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Run `make dotenv`."
msgstr "Spustiť `make dotenv`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Run `make install-alias` to install the aliases into your shell config; afterwards open a new shell or `source ~/.bashrc`."
msgstr "Spustiť `make install-alias` inštalovať prezývky do vašej shell config; potom otvoriť novú shell alebo `source ~/.bashrc`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Run `make test-integration` (or `make test-lint` for lint tests) and verify all tests pass."
msgstr "Spustiť `make test-integration` (alebo `make test-lint` v prípade testov na lint) a overí všetky skúšky."

