msgstr "Spustiť `make test` Pred nasadením musia všetky testy na lízanie a jednotky prejsť."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Run `python -m cli.contributing.network.diagnose` to print a structured DNS / TCP / TLS / PMTU report (IPv4 + IPv6) plus interface MTU, `/etc/resolv.conf`, `/etc/hosts`, proxy env vars, and CA bundle summaries from inside the running infinito container. Exposed as `make diagnose-network`."
msgstr "Spustiť `python -m cli.contributing.network.diagnose` vytlačiť štruktúrovaný report DNS / TCP / TLS / PMTU (IPv4 + IPv6) plus rozhranie MTU, `/etc/resolv.conf`, `/etc/hosts`, proxy env vars, a CA zväzok zhrnutia zvnútra bežiace infinito kontajnera. Odhalený ako `make diagnose-network`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Run `python -m cli.contributing.update.source --dry-run` to list pending bumps; the `update-version-sources` job of `.github/workflows/cron-update.yml` opens the PRs, and `tests/external/update/source/` warns about them."
msgstr "Spustiť `python -m cli.contributing.update.source --dry-run` zoznam čakajúcich hrbolčekov; `update-version-sources` práca `.github/workflows/cron-update.yml` otvára PR a `tests/external/update/source/` varuje pred nimi."

