# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Snipe-IT is entered through a trusted-header bridge: the oauth2-proxy authenticates against Keycloak and Snipe-IT's `loginViaRemoteUser()` mints a native session for the matching `users.username` row (see [`files/php/apply/sso_config.php`](./files/php/apply/sso_config.php)). The gate declares no `allowed_groups`, so `biber` passes the proxy — but the role provisions only the administrator account ([`tasks/03_admin.yml`](./tasks/03_admin.yml)), so the header carries a username Snipe-IT does not know and the visitor falls back to the native login form. [`templates/playwright.env.j2`](./templates/playwright.env.j2) therefore declares `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true`, while the `administrator` persona stays live (`PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=false`) and exercises the full bridge end to end."
msgstr "Snipe-IT je vložený cez dôveryhodný most: oauth2-proxy autentifikáty proti Keycloak a Snipe-IT `loginViaRemoteUser()` mincovne natívne sedenie pre zodpovedajúce `users.username` riadok (Pozri [`files/php/apply/sso_config.php`](./files/php/apply/sso_config.php))Brána vyhlasuje nie `allowed_groups`, takže `biber` prešiel splnomocnenie ([`tasks/03_admin.yml`](./tasks/03_admin.yml)), takže hlavička nesie užívateľské meno Snipe-IT nevie a návštevník spadne späť do rodného prihlasovacieho formulára. [`templates/playwright.env.j2`](./templates/playwright.env.j2) teda deklaruje `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true`, kým `administrator` osoba zostáva na žive (`PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=false`) a precvičuje celý most koniec až do konca."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Snipe-IT is entered through a trusted-header bridge: the oauth2-proxy authenticates against Keycloak and Snipe-IT’s ``loginViaRemoteUser()`` mints a native session for the matching ``users.username`` row (see ```files/php/apply/sso_config.php`` <./files/php/apply/sso_config.php>`__). The gate declares no ``allowed_groups``, so ``biber`` passes the proxy — but the role provisions only the administrator account (```tasks/03_admin.yml`` <./tasks/03_admin.yml>`__), so the header carries a username Snipe-IT does not know and the visitor falls back to the native login form. ```templates/playwright.env.j2`` <./templates/playwright.env.j2>`__ therefore declares ``PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true``, while the ``administrator`` persona stays live (``PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=false``) and exercises the full bridge end to end."
msgstr "Snipe-IT je vložený cez dôveryhodný most: oauth2-proxy autentifikáty proti Keycloak a Snipe-IT ``loginViaRemoteUser()`` mincovne natívne sedenie pre zodpovedajúce ``users.username`` riadok (Pozri ```files/php/apply/sso_config.php`` <./files/php/apply/sso_config.php>`__). The gate declares no ``allowed_groups``, so ``biber`` passes the proxy — but the role provisions only the administrator account (```tasks/03_admin.yml`` <./tasks/03_admin.yml>`__), so the header carries a username Snipe-IT does not know and the visitor falls back to the native login form. ```templates/playwright.env.j2`` <./templates/playwright.env.j2>`__ therefore declares ``PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true``, while the ``administrator`` persona stays live (``PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=false``) a precvičuje celý most koniec až do konca."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Snipe‑IT is an open‑source asset management system designed to streamline hardware and software inventory tracking. This deployment provides an automated, containerized solution using Docker Compose, centralized MariaDB database integration, and secure, configurable environment settings, including robust SMTP email support and pending SAML authentication enhancements."
msgstr "Snipe-IT je open-source systém správy aktív určený na zefektívnenie sledovania hardvéru a softvéru. Toto nasadenie poskytuje automatizované, kontajnerové riešenie pomocou Docker Compose, centralizované MariaDB integrácia databáz, a bezpečné, konfigurovateľné nastavenia prostredia, vrátane robustné SMTP e-mailovej podpory a čaká SAML autentifikačné vylepšenia."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "So `meta/services.yml` MUST NOT have a top-level `services:` key wrapping its content. `meta/volumes.yml` MUST NOT have a top-level `volumes:` key, and the same rule applies to `meta/server.yml`, `meta/rbac.yml`, `meta/users.yml`, and `meta/info.yml`. The filename alone fixes the path prefix in the materialised application tree, which keeps consumer paths short and predictable (no redundant `compose.…` prefixes)."
msgstr "Takže. `meta/services.yml` NESMIE mať najvyššiu úroveň `services:` kľúčové balenie jeho obsahu. `meta/volumes.yml` NESMIE mať najvyššiu úroveň `volumes:` kľúč, a to isté pravidlo platí pre `meta/server.yml`, `meta/rbac.yml`, `meta/users.yml`, a `meta/info.yml`. Názov súboru sám opraví predponu trasy v materializovanom aplikačnom strome, ktorý udržuje spotrebné cesty krátke a predvídateľné (žiadny nadbytočný `compose.…` predpony)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "So a conditional `\"{{ 'web-app-matomo' in group_names }}\"` edge pulls its provider into the static closure regardless of whether `web-app-matomo` is actually selected. The closure is the co-deploy superset."
msgstr "Takže podmienka `\"{{ 'web-app-matomo' in group_names }}\"` okraj vytiahne svojho poskytovateľa do statického uzavretia bez ohľadu na to, či `web-app-matomo` je skutočne vybraný. Uzavretie je kode-deploy superset."

# translated-by: libretranslate
#, python-brace-format
msgid "So the format is read from the workflow itself. Every input renders as one segment, ``<head><value> ``, where the head is the emoji the workflow's own ``format('🐧{0} ', …)`` prefixes the value with. An input holding its default renders no segment at all, so a title carries only what deviates — and an absent input means \"the workflow's default\", which is exactly what a retrigger should leave alone."
msgstr "Takže formát je čítaný zo samotného workflow. Každý vstup predstavuje jeden segment, ``<head><value> ``, kde hlava je emoji workflow je vlastné ``format('🐧{0} ', …)`` predpony hodnoty s. Vstup, ktorý má svoju predvolenú hodnotu, vôbec nespôsobí segment, takže titul nesie len to, čo sa odchyľuje a neprítomný vstup znamená \"predvolený pracovný postup\", čo je presne to, čo retraktor by mal nechať na pokoji."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Soft quota for the default blobstore. Computed as half free disk at the cache path, floor `2g`."
msgstr "Mäkká kvóta pre štandardné blobstore. Vypočítaný ako polovičný voľný disk na ceste vyrovnávacej pamäte, podlaha `2g`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Solid `1:1` edges are fixed relationships; dashed `0..1` edges are conditional (enabled only in matching deployments); red `0..0` edges are turned off in this role. Node markers show the role's deploy modes (💻 host, 🐳 compose, 🐝 swarm); ❌ marks a service that is explicitly turned off, and ⚙️ an Ansible role dependency declared in `meta/main.yml`."
msgstr "Tuhá látka `1:1` okraje sú pevné vzťahy; prerušované `0..1` hrany sú podmienené (povolené iba pri zodpovedajúcich nasadeniach); červená `0..0` okraje sú v tejto úlohe vypnuté. Značky uzla ukazujú režimy nasadenia role (💻 hostiteľ, 🐳 kompozíciu, 🐝 roj); ❌ označuje službu, ktorá je výslovne vypnutá, a ⚙️ an Ansible role dependent in `meta/main.yml`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Some CI failures (most notably OOM-kills such as [#162](https://github.com/infinito-nexus/core/issues/162), PeerTube plugin install with `rc=137`) only surface under the memory and CPU ceiling of the GitHub-hosted runner and cannot be reproduced on a workstation with plenty of RAM. To reproduce these failures locally, you MUST cap the resources of the top-level `infinito` service in [compose.yml](../../../../compose.yml) to values that match (or undercut) the runner specs below."
msgstr "Niektoré zlyhania CI (najmä OOM-kills, ako je [#162](https://github.com/infinito-nexus/core/issues/162), PeerTube inštalácia modulu s `rc=137`) iba povrch pod pamäťou a CPU stropom GitHub-hosted bežec a nemožno reprodukovať na pracovnej stanici s množstvom RAM. Ak chcete reprodukovať tieto zlyhania lokálne, musíte obmedziť zdroje najvyššej úrovne `infinito` služba v [compose.yml](../../../../compose.yml) k hodnotám, ktoré zodpovedajú (alebo podhodnotené) Runner specs nižšie."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Some Python files use Ruff-compatible uppercase `# noqa` codes. Ruff and related Python linters handle these, not [suppress.py](../../../../utils/annotations/suppress.py). They MAY appear when the local exception is intentional and clear from context."
msgstr "Niektoré Python súbory používajú veľké písmená kompatibilné s Ruffom `# noqa` kódy. Ruff a príbuzní Python Linters ich ovládajú, nie [suppress.py](../../../../utils/annotations/suppress.py). MÔŽU sa objaviť, keď je miestna výnimka úmyselná a jasná z kontextu."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Some commands use `sudo`."
msgstr "Niektoré príkazy použiť `sudo`."

