# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Swarm mode"
msgstr "Režim ramien"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Swarm mode    - `<stack>_<service_key>`, matching how Docker Swarm names every service and how `container service ps` accepts them. The stack name is derived from ``application_id`` via the ``get_entity_name`` filter, mirroring how ``docker stack deploy`` composes the stack name in ``sys-svc-compose/handlers/main.yml``."
msgstr "Režim ram - `<stack>_<service_key>`, zodpovedajúce ako Docker Swarm menuje každú službu a ako `container service ps` prijíma ich. Názov stohu je odvodený od ``application_id`` prostredníctvom ``get_entity_name`` filter, zrkadlenie ako ``docker stack deploy`` skladá názov stohu v ``sys-svc-compose/handlers/main.yml``."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Swarm mode    - a shell subshell that resolves the running task's container ID at exec time, e.g. `\"$(/usr/bin/resolve-container-id mattermost mattermost)\"`. Swarm names every service ``<stack>_<key>`` and accepts no prefix matching; the helper composes that name from STACK and SERVICE_KEY args. The subshell defers resolution to the moment of exec, avoiding the stale ID and parse-time-failure pitfalls of returning a resolved value at vars-resolution time."
msgstr "Režim ramien - subshell, ktorý rozlúšti ID kontajnera spustenej úlohy v čase exec, napr. `\"$(/usr/bin/resolve-container-id mattermost mattermost)\"`. Pomenuje každú službu. ``<stack>_<key>`` a neprijíma žiadne predpony zodpovedajúce; pomocník skladá toto meno zo STACK a SERVICE_KEY Args. Podschéma odkladá rozlíšenie na moment exec, vyhýbanie sa identifikátoru stale ID a pasce zlyhania parse-time návratu vyriešenej hodnoty v čase rozlíšenia vars."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Swarm mode    - the same reference, prefixed with the in-cluster registry host:port (e.g. ``manager.example.com:5000/mattermost/mattermost-team-edition:11.8.0``) when ``swarm.registry.host`` and ``swarm.registry.port`` are set. With no registry configured, swarm falls back to the un-prefixed form."
msgstr "Režim ram - rovnaký odkaz, predpona s in-cluster registra hostiteľa:port (napr. ``manager.example.com:5000/mattermost/mattermost-team-edition:11.8.0``) keď ``swarm.registry.host`` a ``swarm.registry.port`` sú pripravené. Bez konfigurácie registra, roj spadne späť do ne-predfixnej formy."

