# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Tests in this directory MUST only cover the four classifications of a single project-wide match stream: literal-app calls (`test_literal_paths.py`), variable-app calls with an existing literal path (`test_variable_paths.py`), `~`-concatenated path expressions (`test_wildcard_paths.py`), and the strict per-role pass for `lookup('config', application_id, …)` calls inside `roles/<role>/...` (`test_role_local_paths.py`). Pure unit coverage of the lookup plugin's return values MUST live under `tests/unit/python/plugins/lookup/`."
msgstr "Testy v tomto adresári MUSIA zahŕňať len štyri klasifikácie jedného projektu-široký zápas stream: doslovné-apple hovory (`test_literal_paths.py`), volania s variabilnou aplikáciou s existujúcou doslovnou cestou (`test_variable_paths.py`), `~`-Konfigurované výrazy cesty (`test_wildcard_paths.py`), a prísne per-role pass pre `lookup('config', application_id, …)` hovory vnútri `roles/<role>/...` (`test_role_local_paths.py`). Čistá jednotková pokrytie hľadá plugin je návratové hodnoty MUSÍ žiť pod `tests/unit/python/plugins/lookup/`."

