msgstr "Hostiteľský názov aplikácie Docker/OCI: ``bounded_name`` na 63-Byte limit sethostname(2) vymáha."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The Flowise supervisor criteria are Phase 2, and reading both upstreams turned \"not built yet\" into a concrete blocker: `stdio_only`, the same reason `web-app-discourse` carries in [ADR 0003](../architecture/decisions/0003-mcp-surface-per-provider.md). Neither agent's server mode speaks a transport a second container can reach."
msgstr "EÚ Flowise Kritériá dohľadu sú fáza 2, a čítanie oboch proti prúdu otočené \"ešte nepostavený\" do betónového blokátora: `stdio_only`, rovnaký dôvod `web-app-discourse` prenáša [ADR 0003](../architecture/decisions/0003-mcp-surface-per-provider.md). Ani jeden agent server režim hovorí transport druhý kontajner môže dosiahnuť."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The Frappe MCP component is experimental and unverified against the pinned Frappe v16."
msgstr "Frappe MCP zložka je experimentálna a neoverená proti pripnutej Frappe v16."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The Frappe site-setup wizard is **bypassed** on first deploy via auto-bootstrap: `bench new-site` with `--admin-password`, `--db-name`, `--mariadb-user-host-login-scope=%` arguments, plus `bench install-app erpnext`, plus a post-start API call from the role's `tasks/` to mark the wizard as completed (`frappe.db.set_default('setup_complete', '1')`). A fresh deploy lands directly on the ERPNext desk."
msgstr "Čarodejník Frappe je **obtok** pri prvom nasadení cez autobootstrap: `bench new-site` s `--admin-password`, `--db-name`, `--mariadb-user-host-login-scope=%` argumenty plus `bench install-app erpnext`, plus post-start API výzva z role `tasks/` označiť sprievodcu ako dokončeného (`frappe.db.set_default('setup_complete', '1')`). Čerstvé rozmiestniť pozemky priamo na ERPNext stôl."

# translated-by: libretranslate
