msgid "The cluster consists of privileged systemd containers on a dedicated lab bridge (`192.168.244.0/24`, MTU 1400): three swarm nodes (1 manager + 2 workers), a non-swarm NFSv4 server serving the shared volume storage, and a non-swarm backup host for the DR drill. The node image ([`compose/swarm/Dockerfile`](../../../../compose/swarm/Dockerfile)) bakes python3 + dnsmasq and masks the zfs boot units the parent image's userland enables; the containers and the lab network are declared in [`compose/swarm/compose.yml`](../../../../compose/swarm/compose.yml) (project `${SWARM_NAME}`, backup host behind the `drill` profile) and started by one `docker compose up` in `routine/01_bootstrap.sh`. Lab DNS is provisioned by `compose/swarm/playbook.yml` over `ansible_connection: docker` (Ansible never uses ssh here); swarm init/join itself happens inside the deploy via the `svc-swarm-node` role, not in any bring-up script."
msgstr "Zoskupenie pozostáva z privilegovaných systémových kontajnerov na vyhradenom laboratórnom moste (`192.168.244.0/24`, MTU 1400): tri rojové uzly (1 manažér + 2 pracovníci), a non-swarm NFSv4 server slúžiaci spoločnému úložisku objemu a neteplý záložný hostiteľ pre vŕtačku DR. Obrázok uzla ([`compose/swarm/Dockerfile`](../../../../compose/swarm/Dockerfile)) pakes pytón3 + dnsmasq a maskuje zfs boot jednotky, ktoré materská obrazová plocha umožňuje; kontajnery a laboratórna sieť sú deklarované v [`compose/swarm/compose.yml`](../../../../compose/swarm/compose.yml) (projekt `${SWARM_NAME}`, záložný hostiteľ za `drill` profil) a začal jeden `docker compose up` on `routine/01_bootstrap.sh`. Lab DNS je zabezpečená `compose/swarm/playbook.yml` koniec `ansible_connection: docker` (Ansible tu nikdy nepoužíva ssh); roj init/pripojiť sa stane vnútri rozmiestnenie prostredníctvom `svc-swarm-node` rola, nie v žiadnom skripte."

