msgstr "Prvý `roles/web-app-nextcloud/vars/plugins/sociallogin.yml` vypúšťa sa; install/enable/configure úlohy čítané `applications.web-app-nextcloud.addons.sociallogin.config` miesto toho."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The forward is per-variant: `meta/variants.yml` may drop the flag, and the role then loses the `HiddenServicePort` in that variant."
msgstr "Forward je variačný: `meta/variants.yml` môže zhodiť vlajku, a úloha potom stratí `HiddenServicePort` v tomto variante."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The four served schemas are pinned in [`files/mcp/tools.json`](./files/mcp/tools.json) and hashed into `tools.schema_sha256`; the adapter refuses to start when the two disagree."
msgstr "Štyri servírované schémy sú pripnuté [`files/mcp/tools.json`](./files/mcp/tools.json) a hashed do `tools.schema_sha256`; adaptér odmieta začať, keď obaja nesúhlasia."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The four served schemas are pinned in ```files/mcp/tools.json`` <./files/mcp/tools.json>`__ and hashed into ``tools.schema_sha256``; the adapter refuses to start when the two disagree."
msgstr "Štyri servírované schémy sú pripnuté ```files/mcp/tools.json`` <./files/mcp/tools.json>`__ and hashed into ``tools.schema_sha256``; adaptér odmieta začať, keď obaja nesúhlasia."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The front-page CSP + canonical-domain baseline is ungated and always runs."
msgstr "Predná strana CSP + základná línia kanonickej domény je neriadená a vždy beží."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The full CSP test surface lives in the same module: `assertCspResponseHeader(response, label)` (returns the parsed directive map), `assertCspMetaParity(page, headerDirectives, label)` (verifies the optional `<meta http-equiv>` echo is a subset of the response header), `installCspViolationObserver(page)` + `readCspViolations(page)` (DOM-side `securitypolicyviolation` capture), `expectNoCspViolations(page, diagnostics, label)` (asserts neither the DOM stream nor `diagnostics.cspRelated` carries a violation), and the `EXPECTED_CSP_DIRECTIVES` constant. Specs MUST require these from `./personas`; inline copies are forbidden and caught at review."
msgstr "Celý skúšobný povrch CSP žije v tom istom module: `assertCspResponseHeader(response, label)` (vracia prehľadnú mapu smernice), `assertCspMetaParity(page, headerDirectives, label)` (overí voliteľnosť `<meta http-equiv>` echo je podskupina hlavičky odpovede), `installCspViolationObserver(page)` + `readCspViolations(page)` (Strana DOM `securitypolicyviolation` zachytenie), `expectNoCspViolations(page, diagnostics, label)` (tvrdí, že ani prúd DOM, ani `diagnostics.cspRelated` nesie porušenie), a `EXPECTED_CSP_DIRECTIVES` konštantné. Specs MUSÍ vyžadovať tieto od `./personas`; inline kópie sú zakázané a chytené na kontrolu."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The full branch name MUST follow one of the patterns below, depending on whether the change targets a specific role or is general:"
msgstr "Úplný názov pobočky MUSÍ nasledovať jeden z nižšie uvedených vzorcov v závislosti od toho, či sa zmena zameriava na konkrétnu úlohu, alebo je všeobecná:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The full contributor guide is available at [docs.infinito.nexus](https://docs.infinito.nexus/)."
msgstr "Príručka pre všetkých prispievateľov je k dispozícii na: [docs.infinito.nexus](https://docs.infinito.nexus/)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The full documentation portal is available at [docs.infinito.nexus](https://docs.infinito.nexus/)."
msgstr "Kompletný dokumentačný portál je k dispozícii na [docs.infinito.nexus](https://docs.infinito.nexus/)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The full path string."
msgstr "Plná cesta."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The gate is applied inside [push_ci_policy.sh](../../../../../scripts/meta/resolve/push_ci_policy.sh), which the `run-policy` job invokes. When `GITHUB_REF == refs/heads/main` and `CI_RUN_ON_MAIN != 'true'`, the job emits `should_run=false` and every downstream job is skipped."
msgstr "Brána sa aplikuje vnútri [push_ci_policy.sh](../../../../../scripts/meta/resolve/push_ci_policy.sh), ktoré `run-policy` pracovné požiadavky. Kedy `GITHUB_REF == refs/heads/main` a `CI_RUN_ON_MAIN != 'true'`, práca emituje `should_run=false` a každá ďalšia práca je preskočená."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The gateway is therefore pinned on **variant 2** for every consumer that ships three variants, and left on variant 0 for the two-variant roles, whose round 2 falls back to it. One `make compose-deploy variant=2` run exercises eight of the nine confirmed roles. `web-app-nextcloud` is the exception: its AI surface has always lived on its own variant 7, alongside the other bridged partners it distributes across budget bins."
msgstr "Brána je preto zapnutá **variant 2** pre každého spotrebiteľa, ktorý prepravuje tri varianty a nechal na variante 0 pre dvojvariantné roly, ktorých kolo 2 Vráti sa k tomu. Jeden `make compose-deploy variant=2` beh cvičenia osem z deviatich potvrdených rolí. `web-app-nextcloud` je výnimka: jeho povrch AI vždy žil na svojom vlastnom variante 7, spolu s ostatnými preklenovanými partnermi distribuuje cez rozpočtové koše."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The gateway mints its virtual keys from the inventory it is deployed from, and a workstation is deployed from a different one. The key is therefore an operator-supplied credential on the workstation side: mint it on the server, then put it into the workstation inventory."
msgstr "Brána minti svoje virtuálne kľúče z inventára je nasadený z, a pracovná stanica je nasadená z iného. Kľúčom je preto vierohodnosť prevádzkovateľa na strane pracovnej stanice: mätuj ju na serveri a potom ju vlož do inventára pracovnej stanice."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The gateway publishes no `anthropic/*` model"
msgstr "Brána publikuje nie `anthropic/*` model"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The gateway publishes no `openai/*` model, and the CLI test asserts their absence"
msgstr "Brána publikuje nie `openai/*` model a test CLI tvrdí svoju neprítomnosť"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The gateway publishes no `openrouter/auto` model"
msgstr "Brána publikuje nie `openrouter/auto` model"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The generated Root CA certificate can be injected into containers (e.g. via `sys-svc-compose-ca`) so that containers trust your internal TLS endpoints."
msgstr "Vygenerovaný koreňový CA certifikát môže byť vstreknutý do kontajnerov (napr. prostredníctvom `sys-svc-compose-ca`) tak, že kontajnery dôverujú svoje vnútorné TLS ciele."

