msgid "The in-play loader (`utils.cache.applications.get_merged_applications`) uses each role's variant-free base config (the assembled `meta/<topic>.yml` payload) as the default and lets the inventory's `applications.<app>` overrides win via deep merge: the inventory itself is the source of truth for what variant a round runs against. Variant 0 enumerates every dynamic service-key from `meta/services.yml` with `enabled: true, shared: true` so the \"all flags on\" baseline is explicit and deep-merge with a non-baseline override yields the expected variant-N shape (see [variants.md](../artefact/files/role/variants.md) for the file-format rule and [test_non_baseline_explicit_disables.py](../../../tests/integration/roles/meta/variants/test_non_baseline_explicit_disables.py) for the lint guard)."
msgstr "Hrací nakladač (`utils.cache.applications.get_merged_applications`) používa konfiguráciu bez variantu každej role (zmontované `meta/<topic>.yml` užitočné zaťaženie) ako predvolený a umožňuje inventár `applications.<app>` prepíše výhru prostredníctvom hlbokého zlúčenia: samotný inventár je zdrojom pravdy pre ktorý variant kolo beží proti. Variant 0 pomenuje každý dynamický servisný kľúč od `meta/services.yml` s `enabled: true, shared: true` Takže \"všetky vlajky na\" Východisková hodnota je explicitná a hlboká s nevýchodiskovým preradením získa očakávaný tvar variantu N (Pozri [variants.md](../artefact/files/role/variants.md) pre pravidlo súboru a [test_non_baseline_explicit_disables.py](../../../tests/integration/roles/meta/variants/test_non_baseline_explicit_disables.py) pre strážcu linty)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The include set passed to stage 2 is built per round by the matrix planner: [deploy/cli.py](../../../cli/administration/deploy/development/deploy/cli.py) and [init.py](../../../cli/administration/deploy/development/init.py) call `plan_dev_inventory_matrix` in [planner.py](../../../cli/administration/deploy/development/inventory/planner.py), which resolves each round's include via `_resolve_round_include` in [legacy_resolver.py](../../../cli/administration/deploy/development/inventory/legacy_resolver.py) using the [CombinedResolver](../../../cli/meta/roles/applications/resolution/combined/resolver.py) with `follow_run_after=False`. The swarm test path computes its include separately via [derive_includes.py](../../../utils/tests/swarm/derive_includes.py), reading the active variant map from `INFINITO_APP_VARIANTS`. Both expand the selection along two transitive paths:"
msgstr "Obsahuje súbor prešiel do etapy 2 je postavený na kolo podľa matrice plánovač: [deploy/cli.py](../../../cli/administration/deploy/development/deploy/cli.py) a [init.py](../../../cli/administration/deploy/development/init.py) Volanie `plan_dev_inventory_matrix` on [planner.py](../../../cli/administration/deploy/development/inventory/planner.py), ktorý rieši každé kolo patrí cez `_resolve_round_include` on [legacy_resolver.py](../../../cli/administration/deploy/development/inventory/legacy_resolver.py) s použitím [Kombinované riešenie](../../../cli/meta/roles/applications/resolution/combined/resolver.py) s `follow_run_after=False`. Roj skúšobnej dráhy počíta jeho zahŕňa samostatne cez [derive_includes.py](../../../utils/tests/swarm/derive_includes.py), čítanie active variant mapu z `INFINITO_APP_VARIANTS`. Obaja rozšíriť výber po dvoch tranzitných cestách:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The index is rebuilt on every run so it cannot drift from what is on disk: a manually deleted index gets restored, and a stale link to a removed archive gets dropped. The function stays byte-idempotent: when the resulting content matches what is already on disk, the file is not rewritten."
msgstr "Index je prestavaný na každom spustení, takže sa nemôže odchyľovať od toho, čo je na disku: ručne zmazaný index sa obnoví, a stale odkaz na odstránený archív sa spustí. Funkcia zostáva bajte-idempotentná: keď výsledný obsah zodpovedá tomu, čo je už na disku, súbor nie je prepísaný."

