# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The role publishes a public documentation site. [`meta/services.yml`](./meta/services.yml) pins `sso.enabled` and `sso.shared` to `false`, and the role ships no `meta/users.yml` and no account provisioning; [`templates/env.j2`](./templates/env.j2) only configures the build service. [`tasks/main.yml`](./tasks/main.yml) only wires the container and proxy stack and stages the Sphinx tooling into the build context. There is no account and no auth chain for the `biber` or `administrator` persona, so [`templates/playwright.env.j2`](./templates/playwright.env.j2) declares `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true` and `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=true`. The `guest` persona and the baseline reachability and CSP assertions run unconditionally."
msgstr "Úloha uverejňuje verejnú dokumentáciu. [`meta/services.yml`](./meta/services.yml) kolíky `sso.enabled` a `sso.shared` do `false`, a úloha lodí `meta/users.yml` a žiadne rezervovanie účtov; [`templates/env.j2`](./templates/env.j2) iba konfiguruje službu budovania. [`tasks/main.yml`](./tasks/main.yml) iba drôty kontajnera a proxy stoh a etapy Sfinx nástroje do konštrukcie kontextu. Neexistuje žiadny účet a auth reťaz pre `biber` alebo `administrator` osobnosť, takže [`templates/playwright.env.j2`](./templates/playwright.env.j2) vyhlásenie `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true` a `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=true`. `guest` persona a základná dosiahnuteľnosť a CSP tvrdenia bežia bezpodmienečne."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The role publishes a public documentation site. ```meta/services.yml`` <./meta/services.yml>`__ pins ``sso.enabled`` and ``sso.shared`` to ``false``, and the role ships no ``meta/users.yml`` and no account provisioning; ```templates/env.j2`` <./templates/env.j2>`__ only configures the build service. ```tasks/main.yml`` <./tasks/main.yml>`__ only wires the container and proxy stack and stages the Sphinx tooling into the build context. There is no account and no auth chain for the ``biber`` or ``administrator`` persona, so ```templates/playwright.env.j2`` <./templates/playwright.env.j2>`__ declares ``PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true`` and ``PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=true``. The ``guest`` persona and the baseline reachability and CSP assertions run unconditionally."
msgstr "Úloha uverejňuje verejnú dokumentáciu. ```meta/services.yml`` <./meta/services.yml>`__ pins ``sso.enabled`` and ``sso.shared`` to ``false``, and the role ships no ``meta/users.yml`` and no account provisioning; ```templates/env.j2`` <./templates/env.j2>`__ only configures the build service. ```tasks/main.yml`` <./tasks/main.yml>`__ only wires the container and proxy stack and stages the Sphinx tooling into the build context. There is no account and no auth chain for the ``biber`` or ``administrator`` persona, so ```templates/playwright.env.j2`` <./templates/playwright.env.j2>`__ declares ``PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true`` and ``PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=true``. The ``guest`` persona a základná dosiahnuteľnosť a CSP tvrdenia bežia bezpodmienečne."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The role renders ``settings.yml`` from the deployment’s own secret key and mounts it read-only. ``formats`` carries ``json`` next to ``html``, because a machine consumer gets HTTP 403 on the JSON endpoint otherwise, and the rate limiter is off since the only clients are platform services on the container network."
msgstr "Úloha robí ``settings.yml`` z nasadenia a vlastný tajný kľúč a pripojí ho len na čítanie. ``formats`` nosí ``json`` vedľa ``html``, pretože stroj spotrebiteľ dostane HTTP 403 na JSON koncový bod inak, a obmedzovač sadzieb je vypnutý, pretože jediní klienti sú služby platformy v kontajnerovej sieti."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The role renders `settings.yml` from the deployment's own secret key and mounts it read-only. `formats` carries `json` next to `html`, because a machine consumer gets HTTP 403 on the JSON endpoint otherwise, and the rate limiter is off since the only clients are platform services on the container network."
msgstr "Úloha robí `settings.yml` z vlastného tajného kľúča nasadenia a pripojí ho len na čítanie. `formats` nosí `json` vedľa `html`, pretože stroj spotrebiteľ dostane HTTP 403 na JSON koncový bod inak, a obmedzovač sadzieb je vypnutý, pretože jediní klienti sú služby platformy v kontajnerovej sieti."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The role runs the `-full` image, which carries the OCR and language packs, and serves it on port 9998 inside the container network only. No port is published and no proxy entry is created."
msgstr "Úloha `-full` obraz, ktorý nesie OCR a jazykové balíčky, a slúži mu v prístave 9998 len vo vnútri kontajnerovej siete. Žiadny port nie je publikovaný a žiadny proxy vstup nie je vytvorený."

