# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role stores and manages per-user application tokens in a local YAML store file (idempotent read/write helpers)."
msgstr "Táto úloha ukladá a spravuje na užívateľa aplikácie žetóny v miestnom súbore YAML (idempotentní pomocníci pre čítanie/ zápis)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role supercharge your project management with Taiga, a dynamic, agile tool designed for teams that thrive on creativity and collaboration. Experience a vibrant interface, robust task tracking, and an energetic platform that drives your projects to success."
