# translated-by: libretranslate
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Three settings keys in `vars/main.yml` are silent no-ops on v6.2.0: `security.enable_captcha`, `security.captcha_key` and `security.captcha_secret`. The live `settings` table carries a single `security.captcha` object (`{\"altcha\": {…}, \"hcaptcha\": {\"key\", \"secret\", \"enabled\"}}`), so all three `UPDATE`s match zero rows and neither `ON_ERROR_STOP` nor the reaper notices. hCaptcha has therefore never been active, which also makes the `HCAPTCHA_SERVICE_ENABLED` rationale in `templates/playwright.env.j2` describe protection that is not there. Rewrite the three keys as one object, then decide whether a captcha on the public subscription form is wanted at all."
msgstr "Tri nastavenia v `vars/main.yml` sú tiché no-op na v6.2.0: `security.enable_captcha`, `security.captcha_key` a `security.captcha_secret`. Živý. `settings` stôl má jednu `security.captcha` objekt (`{\"altcha\": {…}, \"hcaptcha\": {\"key\", \"secret\", \"enabled\"}}`), takže všetky tri `UPDATE`s zodpovedajú nula riadkov a ani jedno `ON_ERROR_STOP` ani si to nevšimne žnec. hCaptcha preto nikdy nebol aktívny, čo tiež `HCAPTCHA_SERVICE_ENABLED` odôvodnenie `templates/playwright.env.j2` opíšte ochranu, ktorá tam nie je. Prepísať tri kľúče ako jeden objekt, potom rozhodnúť, či captcha na verejnom predplatného formulára je žiaduce vôbec."

