msgid "Walk a (possibly nested) credentials schema and emit one vault block per scalar leaf into ``dest_node``. Nested dicts (e.g. ``secrets.credentials.recaptcha = {key, secret}``) recurse into nested CommentedMaps so each leaf becomes its own vault-encrypted entry instead of being collapsed via ``str(dict)`` into a Python-repr blob (the regression that broke run 26428080957 jobs 77797371397 and 77797371442 for web-app-espocrm and web-app-listmonk)."
msgstr "Chodiť (prípadne vnorené) Definície schémy a emitovať jeden blok trezoru na skalár list do ``dest_node``. Hniezdené kocky (napr. ``secrets.credentials.recaptcha = {key, secret}``) znovu vnorené CommentedMaps, takže každý list sa stane jeho vlastné šifrované trezor miesto toho, aby sa zrútil cez ``str(dict)`` do Python-repr blob (regresia, ktorá zlomila beh 26428080957 pracovné miesta 77797371397 a 77797371442 namiesto web-app-espocrm a web-app-listmonk)."

