# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[ ] `SEMAPHORE_ACCESS_KEY_ENCRYPTION` and the cookie hash/encryption secrets are generated once and persisted in the role's secret store (idempotent across redeploys)."
msgstr "[ ] `SEMAPHORE_ACCESS_KEY_ENCRYPTION` a cookie hash / šifrovanie tajomstvá sú generované raz a pretrváva v tajnom obchode role (Idelpotentné medzi prerozdeleniami)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[ ] `SEMAPHORE_ADMIN`, `SEMAPHORE_ADMIN_PASSWORD`, `SEMAPHORE_ADMIN_NAME`, `SEMAPHORE_ADMIN_EMAIL` seed a break-glass local admin (dedicated `breakglass` login + dedicated email, no collision with the SSO/LDAP identities) in **every** variant; no setup wizard is presented on first load. Its form login is reachable only when LDAP is disabled (Semaphore forces LDAP-only form auth otherwise)."
msgstr "[ ] `SEMAPHORE_ADMIN`, `SEMAPHORE_ADMIN_PASSWORD`, `SEMAPHORE_ADMIN_NAME`, `SEMAPHORE_ADMIN_EMAIL` semeno lámacie sklo miestny admin (vyhradené `breakglass` Prihlásenie + venovaný e-mail, bez zrážky s identitami SSO/LDAP) on **každých** variant; žiadny sprievodca nastavením nie je prezentovaný na prvom načítaní. Prihlásenie jeho formy je dosiahnuteľné len vtedy, keď je LDAP vypnutý (Simaphore sily LDAP-len forma auth inak)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[ ] `SEMAPHORE_DB_DIALECT=postgres` plus `SEMAPHORE_DB_HOST/PORT/USER/PASS/SEMAPHORE_DB` are wired; when `services.postgres.shared=true` the role consumes the central `svc-db-postgres` (no per-role engine), else `sys-svc-rdbms` templates a per-role Postgres."
msgstr "[ ] `SEMAPHORE_DB_DIALECT=postgres` plus `SEMAPHORE_DB_HOST/PORT/USER/PASS/SEMAPHORE_DB` sú drôtové; keď `services.postgres.shared=true` úloha konzumuje ústrednú `svc-db-postgres` (bez motora na pohon), inak `sys-svc-rdbms` šablóny per-role Postgres."

# translated-by: libretranslate
