# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[`meta/services.yml`](./meta/services.yml) pins `sso.enabled`, `logout.enabled` and `email.enabled` to `false`; the role serves a static single-page wheel with no accounts and no auth layer. There is nothing for the `biber` or `administrator` persona to log in to, so [`templates/playwright.env.j2`](./templates/playwright.env.j2) declares `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true` and `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=true`. The `guest` persona and the baseline reachability assertions run unconditionally."
msgstr "[`meta/services.yml`](./meta/services.yml) kolíky `sso.enabled`, `logout.enabled` a `email.enabled` do `false`; rola slúži statické jednostranové koleso bez účtov a bez auth vrstvy. Neexistuje nič pre `biber` alebo `administrator` osoba sa prihlásiť, takže [`templates/playwright.env.j2`](./templates/playwright.env.j2) vyhlásenie `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true` a `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=true`. `guest` persona a základné tvrdenia o dosiahnuteľnosti platia bezpodmienečne."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[`meta/services.yml`](./meta/services.yml) pins `sso.enabled`, `logout.enabled` and `redis.enabled` to `false`; the upstream image is a client-side QR generator with no accounts and no server-side session. There is nothing for the `biber` or `administrator` persona to log in to, so [`templates/playwright.env.j2`](./templates/playwright.env.j2) declares `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true` and `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=true`. The `guest` persona and the baseline reachability assertions run unconditionally."
msgstr "[`meta/services.yml`](./meta/services.yml) kolíky `sso.enabled`, `logout.enabled` a `redis.enabled` do `false`; predný obraz je QR generátor na strane klienta bez účtov a bez serverovej relácie. Neexistuje nič pre `biber` alebo `administrator` osoba sa prihlásiť, takže [`templates/playwright.env.j2`](./templates/playwright.env.j2) vyhlásenie `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true` a `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=true`. `guest` persona a základné tvrdenia o dosiahnuteľnosti platia bezpodmienečne."

