# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[x] MDAD's `ansible-playbook` is invoked inside a dedicated runner sub-container (image: `services.matrix.runner.image`, built locally from `files/flavor/ansible/runner/Dockerfile`) so its Ansible runtime is isolated from Infinito-Nexus's. The runner mounts the Docker socket, systemd dirs, `/matrix`, `/usr/local/bin`, and the MDAD checkout from the deploy container. A `mount --make-rshared /` runs once in the deploy container before the runner starts because MDAD's systemd units bind-mount with `bind-propagation=slave`."
msgstr "[x] MDAD's `ansible-playbook` sa uvádza vo vyhradenom podkontajnerovom kontajneri (Obrázok: `services.matrix.runner.image`, postavený lokálne z `files/flavor/ansible/runner/Dockerfile`) Takže jeho Ansible Runtime je izolovaný od Infinito-Nexus. Bežec pripevní zásuvku Docker, systémové dirs, `/matrix`, `/usr/local/bin`, a kontrola MDAD z rozmiestňovacieho kontajnera. A `mount --make-rshared /` beží raz v kontajneri rozmiestniť pred štartom bežec, pretože MDAD systemd jednotky sa viažu `bind-propagation=slave`."

