msgstr "`--pull` riešenie politík"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`--variant <idx>` pins to one round (same semantics as the `variant=` make arg)."
msgstr "`--variant <idx>` kolíky na jedno kolo (rovnaká sémantika ako `variant=` make arg)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`.../<volume>/files` or host"
msgstr "`.../<volume>/files` alebo hostiteľ"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`.env` (gitignored) is generated by `make dotenv`, which delegates to `python -m cli.meta.env`. It combines `default.env` with runtime-resolved values (selected distro, GHA/Act flags, df/meminfo-derived cache sizes, sha256 secrets, repository owner, ...). Each line in `.env` is preceded by its own comment, so the file is self-describing. Open it after `make dotenv` to inspect the effective value-set together with its documentation."
msgstr "`.env` (gitizogred) vytvára `make dotenv`, ktorý deleguje `python -m cli.meta.env`. Kombinuje `default.env` s vyriešenými hodnotami (vybrané distro, GHA/Act vlajky, df/meminfo- derivované veľkosti vyrovnávacej pamäte, ša256 tajomstvá, majiteľ úložiska, ...). Každý riadok v `.env` predchádza jeho vlastný komentár, takže súbor je samoopisuje. Otvor to po `make dotenv` kontrolovať skutočnú nastavenú hodnotu spolu s jej dokumentáciou."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`.env` is consumed by bash `source` and docker-compose `--env-file`, neither of which round-trips multi-line values; the writer therefore rejects them. Other NIX_CONFIG settings (`accept-flake-config`, `experimental-features`, …) belong in `/etc/nix/nix.conf` (Dockerfile injects them inside the dev container; host operators set them once in `~/.config/nix/nix.conf`)."
msgstr "`.env` sa skonzumuje bash `source` a docker- compose `--env-file`, z ktorých ani jedno nie je viac riadkov; autor ich preto odmieta. Iné NIX_CONFIG Nastavenie (`accept-flake-config`, `experimental-features`, ...) patrí do `/etc/nix/nix.conf` (Dockerfile im vstrekne do dev kontajnera; hostitelia ich nastaviť raz v `~/.config/nix/nix.conf`)."

