# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`CopyQ <https://hluk.github.io/CopyQ/>`__ is a clipboard manager with advanced features such as editing clipboard history, creating custom actions, and scripting support."
msgstr "`CopyQ <https://hluk.github.io/CopyQ/>`__ je správca schránky s pokročilými funkciami, ako je úprava histórie schránky, tvorba vlastných akcií a podpora skriptovania."

# translated-by: libretranslate
