# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`Cosmos`, `Quick Setup` and `Credits` MUST NOT appear in a committed role README. The documentation build derives them from role metadata and writes them into its own scratch checkout, so a committed copy goes stale without anyone noticing. [test_readme.py](../../../../../tests/lint/ansible/roles/test_readme.py) fails on one."
msgstr "`Cosmos`, `Quick Setup` a `Credits` NESMIE sa objavovať v oddanej úlohe README. Zostava dokumentácie ich odvodzuje z rolových metaúdajov a píše ich do vlastnej scratch checkout, takže spáchaná kópia zanikne bez toho, aby si to niekto všimol. [test_readme.py](../../../../../tests/lint/ansible/roles/test_readme.py) zlyhá."

# translated-by: libretranslate
