# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`Cursor <https://cursor.com/>`__ is an AI-first code editor. This role installs it on a workstation."
msgstr "`Cursor <https://cursor.com/>`__ je Al-prvý editor kódov. Táto úloha ho inštaluje na pracovnú stanicu."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`DEPLOYMENT_MODE` is defined at a single point of truth in [group_vars/all/18_swarm.yml](../../../group_vars/all/18_swarm.yml) as `{{ 'swarm' if 'svc-swarm-node' in group_names else 'compose' }}`."
msgstr "`DEPLOYMENT_MODE` je definovaná v jedinom bode pravdy [group_vars/all/18_swarm.yml](../../../group_vars/all/18_swarm.yml) ako `{{ 'swarm' if 'svc-swarm-node' in group_names else 'compose' }}`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`DOCKER_IN_CONTAINER` (`systemd-detect-virt`) toggles DinD behavior."
msgstr "`DOCKER_IN_CONTAINER` (`systemd-detect-virt`) Prepína DinD správanie."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`DOMAIN_PRIMARY` defined once; `LDAP_DN_BASE`, CA identity, contact email derive from it"
msgstr "`DOMAIN_PRIMARY` definovaný raz; `LDAP_DN_BASE`, identity CA, kontaktné e-mail pochádza z neho"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`DOMAIN_PRIMARY` is rendered before the list is emitted"
msgstr "`DOMAIN_PRIMARY` sa vystaví pred vydaním zoznamu"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`DevInventorySpec` is the value type `build_dev_inventory` consumes — it carries everything `infinito administration inventory provision` needs to materialise one development inventory folder. `PlanEntry` is the per-round tuple `plan_dev_inventory_matrix` emits and the deploy wrapper iterates."
msgstr "`DevInventorySpec` je typ hodnoty `build_dev_inventory` konzumuje všetko `infinito administration inventory provision` musí naplniť jeden inventár vývoja. `PlanEntry` je v každom kole tuple `plan_dev_inventory_matrix` emituje a rozmiestňuje obal iteruje."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`Docker Swarm <https://docs.docker.com/engine/swarm/>`__ groups Docker hosts into a single virtual host. A swarm has exactly one manager node in v1; managers run the Raft store and accept service-API calls."
msgstr "`Docker Swarm <https://docs.docker.com/engine/swarm/>`__ skupiny Docker hostí do jedného virtuálneho hostiteľa. Roj má presne jeden manažér uzol v V1; manažéri prevádzkujú obchod Raft a prijímajú služby-API Volá."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`Docker Swarm <https://docs.docker.com/engine/swarm/>`__ is Docker’s built-in clustering and container-orchestration mode. It groups multiple Docker hosts into a single virtual host that can schedule services, replicate tasks, and route traffic via an internal mesh."
msgstr "`Docker Swarm <https://docs.docker.com/engine/swarm/>`__ je Docker Združuje viacero Docker hostí do jedného virtuálneho hostiteľa, ktorý môže naplánovať služby, zopakovať úlohy a trasu dopravy cez vnútornú sieť."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`Dockerfile.sh` exposes 8124 for aiolibdatachannel signalling beside 8099. Nothing listens on it at rest, so only 8099 is published; whether it binds lazily during a call is untested."
msgstr "`Dockerfile.sh` expozície 8124 pre signalizáciu aiolibdatachanable vedľa 8099. Nič nepočúva v pokoji, takže len 8099 je zverejnený; či sa viaže lenivo počas hovoru nie je testovaný."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`DomainLookup` resolves the SMTP host when `environment` points to an external Mailu deployment. Failures MUST fall back to `localhost`."
msgstr "`DomainLookup` rieši SMTP hostiteľa, keď `environment` ukazuje na externý Mailu rozmiestnenie. Zlyhania sa musia vrátiť do `localhost`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`ENABLE_OAUTH_ROLE_MANAGEMENT` maps the application's administrator group onto the Open WebUI admin role, and it also makes `OAUTH_ALLOWED_ROLES` a sign-in gate. The env sets `OAUTH_ALLOWED_ROLES=*` so every platform role passes that gate; narrow it only to a list that matches the `/roles/<app>/<role>` paths Keycloak emits."
msgstr "`ENABLE_OAUTH_ROLE_MANAGEMENT` mapuje skupinu administrátorov aplikácie na Open WebUI admin role, a to tiež robí `OAUTH_ALLOWED_ROLES` vstupnú bránu. Zásielka `OAUTH_ALLOWED_ROLES=*` Takže každá úloha platformy prechádza túto bránu; zúžiť ju len na zoznam, ktorý zodpovedá `/roles/<app>/<role>` cesty Keycloak emituje."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`ERPNext <https://erpnext.com/>`__ is an open-source ERP suite built on the `Frappe Framework <https://frappeframework.com/>`__. It covers finance, CRM, inventory, manufacturing, HR, sales, projects, and websites in one self-hosted stack."
msgstr "`ERPNext <https://erpnext.com/>`__ je open-source ERP apartmán postavený na `Frappe Framework <https://frappeframework.com/>`__. Zahŕňa financie, CRM, inventarizáciu, výrobu, HR, predaj, projekty a webové stránky v jednom samoobsadenom kope."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`Extension:AWS` (S3 file backend)"
msgstr "`Extension:AWS` (S3 backend súboru)"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`External tests` verify live third-party state such as public registries or services when hermetic checks are insufficient."
msgstr "`External tests` overiť živý štát tretej strany, ako sú verejné registre alebo služby, ak sú hermetické kontroly nedostatočné."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`FILE_ENVIRONMENT` (default: `/etc/environment`)"
msgstr "`FILE_ENVIRONMENT` (predvolené: `/etc/environment`)"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`FORCE_CANCEL_AFTER_SECONDS` turns the cancel into an escalation. A cancel request does not stop a running step: the runner asks it to end, and a step that ignores the signal keeps going until its own `timeout-minutes`, which is 350 for a deploy. The concurrency group holds the newer run on `pending` until the occupant is *terminal*, not until it is cancel-requested, so a superseded sweep can block its branch for hours after being told to stop -- measured at eight minutes and counting, with ten deploy jobs untouched. After the wait, every run that is still not `completed` gets [`force-cancel`](https://docs.github.com/en/rest/actions/workflow-runs), which bypasses the conditions that keep it alive. The skipped cleanup steps are the price, and for a run that has already been superseded its artefacts are of no use to anyone. Leave the variable unset to cancel and walk away, which is what a closed pull request and a deleted branch want."
msgstr "`FORCE_CANCEL_AFTER_SECONDS` zmení zrušenie na eskaláciu. Žiadosť o zrušenie nezastaví bežiaci krok: bežec ho žiada, aby skončil, a krok, ktorý ignoruje signál pokračuje, kým jeho vlastné `timeout-minutes`, čo je 350 na rozmiestnenie. Skupina mien drží novší beh na `pending` kým nie je cestujúci *terminál*, nie kým nie je vyžiadané zrušenie, takže náhradné zametanie môže zablokovať svoju vetvu hodiny po tom, čo bolo povedané, aby zastavil -- merané na osem minút a počítanie, s desiatimi rozmiestniť pracovné miesta nedotknuté. Po čakaní, každý beh, ktorý stále nie je `completed` dostane [`force-cancel`](https://docs.github.com/en/rest/actions/workflow-runs), ktorý obíde podmienky, ktoré ho udržať nažive. Preskočené kroky čistenia sú cena, a za beh, ktorý už bol nahradený jeho artefakty sú k ničomu. Premennú nechajte deaktivovanú, aby ste ju zrušili a odkráčali, čo je to, čo je uzavretá žiadosť o ťahanie a vymazaná vetva chcú."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`Fider <https://getfider.com/>`__ is an open-source community feedback and voting platform that allows teams to collect, prioritize, and track feature requests and ideas."
msgstr "`Fider <https://getfider.com/>`__ je open-source community spätná väzba a hlasovacie platforma, ktorá umožňuje tímom zbierať, uprednostňovať, a sledovať požiadavky a nápady funkcie."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`FusionDirectory <https://www.fusiondirectory.org/>`__ is a web-based LDAP administration tool that manages users, groups, and other directory objects through a pluggable interface. The application stores all of its data in an external LDAP directory, which makes it the natural front-end for the project’s ``svc-db-openldap`` backend."
msgstr "`FusionDirectory <https://www.fusiondirectory.org/>`__ je web-based LDAP administratívny nástroj, ktorý spravuje užívateľov, skupiny, a ďalšie adresárové objekty prostredníctvom pluggable rozhranie. Aplikácia ukladá všetky svoje dáta do externého LDAP adresára, čo z neho robí prirodzený front-end pre projekt ``svc-db-openldap`` Backend."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`GET /v1/models` lists both platforms; Open WebUI shows each only to its group through model access grants."
msgstr "`GET /v1/models` zoznam oboch platforiem; Open WebUI ukazuje každý len do svojej skupiny prostredníctvom grantov na prístup k modelom."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`GET /v1/sys/health` returns **503 when sealed** and 501 when uninitialised. The query params `sealedcode`, `uninitcode`, `standbyok` override those codes per request."
msgstr "`GET /v1/sys/health` vracia **503 po zapečatení** a 501 ak nie sú inicializované. Parameter otázky `sealedcode`, `uninitcode`, `standbyok` prepísať tie kódy na žiadosť."

# translated-by: libretranslate
#, python-brace-format
msgid "`GET /v1/sys/metrics?format=prometheus`. Normally token-gated; a listener with `telemetry { unauthenticated_metrics_access = true }` exposes it without a token on that listener only."
msgstr "`GET /v1/sys/metrics?format=prometheus`. Normálne token-gated; poslucháč s `telemetry { unauthenticated_metrics_access = true }` Odhaľuje to bez symbolu len na poslucháča."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`GH_TOKEN` env var"
msgstr "`GH_TOKEN` env var"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`GH_TOKEN` must be available on the Ansible control node (`delegate_to: localhost`) for the `gh api` registration call to succeed. In CI this is forwarded into the DinD container by `cli/administration/deploy/development/deploy/run.py`."
msgstr "`GH_TOKEN` musí byť k dispozícii na uzle Ansible Control (`delegate_to: localhost`) pre `gh api` registračný hovor, aby bol úspešný. V CI sa to prenáša do DinD kontajnera `cli/administration/deploy/development/deploy/run.py`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`GITLAB_ROOT_PASSWORD` ([`templates/env.j2`](./templates/env.j2), from `GITLAB_INIT_ROOT_PASSWORD` in [`vars/main.yml`](./vars/main.yml)) belongs to GitLab's built-in `root` account, not to the Keycloak `administrator` username the persona signs in with, and no GitLab account is provisioned for `biber` at all — the OmniAuth sign-in is the only path that would create one. In the `services.sso.enabled: false` matrix variants that path is removed, so [`templates/playwright.env.j2`](./templates/playwright.env.j2) renders `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true` and `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=true`. The `guest` persona and the baseline assertions run unconditionally."
msgstr "`GITLAB_ROOT_PASSWORD` ([`templates/env.j2`](./templates/env.j2), z `GITLAB_INIT_ROOT_PASSWORD` on [`vars/main.yml`](./vars/main.yml)) patrí do GitLab's vstavané `root` účet, nie na účet Keycloak `administrator` Používateľské meno osoba sa prihlási s a nie GitLab účet je rezervovaný `biber` Vôbec V `services.sso.enabled: false` maticové varianty, ktoré cesta je odstránený, takže [`templates/playwright.env.j2`](./templates/playwright.env.j2) vykresľovanie `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true` a `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=true`. `guest` osoba a základné tvrdenia platia bezpodmienečne."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`GRAPH_LDAP_SERVER_WRITE_ENABLED=false` keeps OpenCloud from modifying the directory. User lifecycle is owned by the LDAP and Keycloak side."
msgstr "`GRAPH_LDAP_SERVER_WRITE_ENABLED=false` uchováva OpenCloud od úpravy adresára. Životný cyklus užívateľa vlastní LDAP a Keycloak strana."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`Generate app token` step"
msgstr "`Generate app token` krok"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`HOST`, `DISTRO`, `COUNT` (optional), `PORT`, `OWNER`, `REPO`"
msgstr "`HOST`, `DISTRO`, `COUNT` (nepovinné), `PORT`, `OWNER`, `REPO`"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`Hermes Agent <https://hermes-agent.nousresearch.com/>`__ is an agent runtime from Nous Research that runs tool-using agent sessions against OpenAI-compatible model backends. In gateway mode it serves an OpenAI-compatible HTTP API, where clients address the agent with the same request shape they use for a plain model."
msgstr "`Hermes Agent <https://hermes-agent.nousresearch.com/>`__ je agent behtime od Nous Research, ktorý beží nástroje-použitie agent sedenie proti OpenAI-kompatibilný model backends. V režime brány slúži OpenAI kompatibilnej HTTP API, kde klienti oslovujú agenta s rovnakým tvarom žiadosti, ktoré používajú pre jednoduchý model."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`Hermes Agent <https://hermes-agent.nousresearch.com/>`__ is an autonomous agent runtime. This role runs it in embodied mode: on a machine that is dedicated to it, with direct access to the hardware of that machine. Where the container roles put a kernel boundary between the agent and its host, here the boundary is the device itself."
msgstr "`Hermes Agent <https://hermes-agent.nousresearch.com/>`__ je autonómny agent beží čas. Táto úloha ju riadi v stelesnenom režime: na stroji, ktorý je jej venovaný, s priamym prístupom k hardvéru tohto stroja. Tam, kde role kontajnera umiestnia hranicu jadra medzi agentom a jeho hostiteľom, tu je hranica samotná zariadenie."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`Home Assistant <https://www.home-assistant.io/>`__ is an open-source home automation platform that connects smart-home devices from many vendors behind a single local interface. It keeps device state, dashboards, and automation rules on the machine that runs it, and exposes them through a web interface, a REST API, and a built-in MCP server."
msgstr "`Home Assistant <https://www.home-assistant.io/>`__ je open-source platforma domácej automatizácie, ktorá spája zariadenia smart-home od mnohých predajcov za jediným miestnym rozhraním. Udržuje stav zariadenia, prístrojové dosky a pravidlá automatizácie na stroji, ktorý ho prevádzkuje, a odhaľuje ich cez webové rozhranie, REST API, a vstavaný MCP server."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`Hugo <https://gohugo.io/>`__ is a fast, single-binary static site generator written in Go. This role builds a Hugo site from any upstream Git repository (default: `gohugoio/hugoDocs <https://github.com/gohugoio/hugoDocs>`__) at image-build time and serves the rendered HTML/CSS/JS via nginx. There is no database, no application server, and no dynamic backend at runtime."
msgstr "`Hugo <https://gohugo.io/>`__ je rýchly, jednobinárny statický generátor napísaný v Go. Táto úloha buduje Hugo miesto z akéhokoľvek protiprúdu Git úložisko (predvolené: `gohugoio/hugoDocs <https://github.com/gohugoio/hugoDocs>`__) v čase budovania obrazu a slúži kované HTML/CSS/JS cez nginx. Neexistuje žiadna databáza, žiadny aplikačný server a žiadny dynamický backend v čase behu."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`INCLUDE_PATHS` — newline-separated workflow paths, the members of the concurrency group being backed up. Without it the helpers would also cancel runs the group never governed, such as the `cron-*` workflows that listen on `push`. Derive the list from the `concurrency:` blocks, not from what looks related: `entry-delete-branch.yml` keys its group on the *deleted* ref, so it is not a member of a push's group, and listing it would make a push to `main` cancel an unrelated branch cleanup. A value that lists no path at all aborts rather than silently matching nothing."
msgstr "`INCLUDE_PATHS` Bez neho by pomocníci tiež zrušili riadenie skupiny nikdy neriadil, ako je `cron-*` pracovné postupy, ktoré počúvajú `push`. Získať zoznam z `concurrency:` bloky, nie z toho, čo vyzerá súvisiace: `entry-delete-branch.yml` Kľúčí svoju skupinu na *odstránené* ref, takže to nie je členom skupiny push's, a výpis by sa tlačiť `main` zrušiť neprepojené čistenie vetvy. Hodnota, ktorá vôbec neuvádza žiadnu cestu, skôr ruší, než ticho ladí s ničím."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`INFINITO_CACHE_PACKAGE_FRONTEND_IP` env var for the inner compose wrapper"
msgstr "`INFINITO_CACHE_PACKAGE_FRONTEND_IP` env var pre vnútorné balenie"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`INFINITO_CACHE_PACKAGE_MAX_AGE_MIN` (default `8640` = 6 days) controls how long every Nexus proxy repo holds an upstream response before revalidating. The bootstrap helper applies it as `contentMaxAge`, `metadataMaxAge`, and `negativeCache.timeToLive`. The default is intentionally one day below the 7-day `Valid-Until` window Debian and Ubuntu generate in their apt `Release` files, so Nexus always refreshes the manifest before `apt-get update` would see it expired. Raise it for slow-moving upstreams when staleness is preferable to upstream load; lower it further for fast-moving feeds (`apt-debian-security`, branch-pinned tarballs) when staleness becomes visible."
msgstr "`INFINITO_CACHE_PACKAGE_MAX_AGE_MIN` (štandardná `8640` = 6 dní) kontroluje, ako dlho má každá proxy repo Nexus protiprúdovú odpoveď pred obnovením platnosti. Pomocník na čižmy ho používa ako `contentMaxAge`, `metadataMaxAge`, a `negativeCache.timeToLive`. Štandard je zámerne jeden deň pod 7-deň `Valid-Until` okno Debian a Ubuntu generovať v ich apt `Release` súbory, takže Nexus vždy osvieži manifest pred `apt-get update` by to videlo vypršať. Zdvihnite ju pre pomalé protiľahlé protiľahlé, keď je lepšie zachytenie pred zaťažením proti prúdu; ďalej ju znižujte pre rýchlo sa pohybujúce kanály (`apt-debian-security`, vetvové dechtové guľky) keď sa stane viditeľnou stagnácia."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`INFINITO_DISTRO`, `INFINITO_CONTAINER`, optional `INSPECT_CMD` or positional args"
msgstr "`INFINITO_DISTRO`, `INFINITO_CONTAINER`, nepovinné `INSPECT_CMD` alebo polohové argy"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`INFINITO_DNS_HOSTS` can still override the generated list explicitly"
msgstr "`INFINITO_DNS_HOSTS` stále môže prepísať generovaný zoznam explicitne"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`INFINITO_VERSION_ENV_NAME` (default: `INFINITO_VERSION`)"
msgstr "`INFINITO_VERSION_ENV_NAME` (predvolené: `INFINITO_VERSION`)"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`Integration tests` verify behavior across modules and runtime boundaries."
msgstr "`Integration tests` overiť správanie cez moduly a časové hranice."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`InventoryManager` resolves the root role's config via `get_variants(roles_dir)[app_id][N]` so `resolve_schema_includes_recursive` sees the variant-merged `services` map and discovers every shared provider the variant enables."
msgstr "`InventoryManager` rieši koreň role konfig cez `get_variants(roles_dir)[app_id][N]` Takže... `resolve_schema_includes_recursive` vidí variant-zmiešaný `services` mapuje a objavuje každého zdieľaného poskytovateľa, ktorý variant umožňuje."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`InventoryManager` skips the variants overlay and reads the role's base `meta/<topic>.yml` payload directly via `_meta_role_config`."
msgstr "`InventoryManager` preskočí varianty prekrývanie a číta základ role `meta/<topic>.yml` užitočné zaťaženie priamo cez `_meta_role_config`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`InventoryManager`-backed credential generator; `--variant N` selects which `variants.yml` overlay applies."
msgstr "`InventoryManager`- backed credential generátor; `--variant N` vyberá, ktoré `variants.yml` platí prekrývanie."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`JELLYFIN_*` env (double-underscore nesting), `JELLYFIN_PublishedServerUrl`, `TZ`; runs as `PUID/PGID`."
msgstr "`JELLYFIN_*` env (dvojbodové hniezdenie), `JELLYFIN_PublishedServerUrl`, `TZ`; beží ako `PUID/PGID`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`Jellyfin <https://jellyfin.org>`__ is a free, open-source media server. This role deploys the official ``jellyfin/jellyfin`` container behind the Infinito.Nexus reverse proxy, with Keycloak OIDC (web) and central LDAP authentication provisioned via the Jellyfin auth plugins."
msgstr "`Jellyfin <https://jellyfin.org>`__ je otvorený mediálny server. Táto úloha rozmiestňuje úradníka ``jellyfin/jellyfin`` kontajner za Infinito.Nexus reverzný proxy s Keycloak OIDC (web) a centrálne overenie LDAP poskytované prostredníctvom Jellyfin Auth plugins."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`Jenkins <https://www.jenkins.io/>`__ is an open-source automation server that orchestrates the build, test, and deployment of software through pipelines, freestyle jobs, and a large plugin ecosystem."
msgstr "`Jenkins <https://www.jenkins.io/>`__ je open-source automatizačný server, ktorý organizuje výstavbu, testovanie a nasadenie softvéru prostredníctvom potrubí, freestyle pracovných miest, a veľký plugin ekosystém."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`Jira <https://www.atlassian.com/>`__ is Atlassian’s issue and project-tracking platform. This role deploys Jira via Docker Compose, connects it to PostgreSQL, and adds proxy awareness, optional OIDC SSO, health checks, and production-oriented defaults for Infinito.Nexus."
msgstr "`Jira <https://www.atlassian.com/>`__ je Atlassians problém a projekt-tracking platforma. Táto úloha nasadzuje Jira via Docker Compose, ho spája s PostgreSQL, a pridáva proxy povedomie, voliteľné OIDC SSO, zdravotné kontroly, a výrobné orientované štandardné pre Infinito.Nexus."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`Jitsi Meet <https://jitsi.org/>`__ is an open-source, end-to-end-encryptable video conferencing platform. Rooms run over WebRTC with a central Selective Forwarding Unit (jvb), an XMPP server (prosody) for signalling, and a conference focus daemon (jicofo)."
msgstr "`Jitsi Meet <https://jitsi.org/>`__ je open-source, end-to-end-šifrovateľná videokonferenčná platforma. Izby prechádzajú cez WebRTC s centrálnou výberovou zasielateľskou jednotkou (jvb), XMPP server (prosody) pre signalizáciu a démon s konferenčným zameraním (jicofo)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`Joomla <https://www.joomla.org/>`__ is a free and open-source content management system that lets users build and run websites, intranets, and online applications without writing code. It exposes a component, module, and plugin architecture that authors and developers extend with custom content types, layouts, and integrations."
msgstr "`Joomla <https://www.joomla.org/>`__ je bezplatný a open-source systém správy obsahu, ktorý umožňuje používateľom vytvárať a prevádzkovať webové stránky, intranety a online aplikácie bez písania kódu. Odhaľuje komponent, modul a plugin architektúru, ktorú autori a vývojári rozširujú o vlastné typy obsahu, rozloženie a integráciu."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`Jrnl <https://jrnl.sh/>`__ is a simple and effective command-line journal application that allows users to create and manage personal journal entries."
msgstr "`Jrnl <https://jrnl.sh/>`__ je jednoduchá a efektívna aplikácia denníka príkazového riadku, ktorá umožňuje používateľom vytvárať a spravovať osobné záznamy denníka."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`Jupyter <https://jupyter.org/>`__ runs code in a managed kernel and returns its output. This role provides that kernel as a backend for other services rather than as a notebook UI for people."
msgstr "`Jupyter <https://jupyter.org/>`__ spustí kód v riadenom jadre a vráti svoj výstup. Táto úloha poskytuje, že jadro ako backend pre iné služby, a nie ako notebook UI pre ľudí."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`KEEP_NEWEST_PER` — keeps the newest run of each group instance alive and cancels only the older ones, which is the rule the concurrency group itself applies. It is what makes the fallback safe against races: the head SHA from the event payload goes stale while the job waits for a runner, and a `[skip ci]` or `GITHUB_TOKEN` push moves the branch tip without creating a run at all. Selecting by \"not the current head\" would then cancel the newest commit's CI and spare the stale one, or leave the branch with no CI at all. Selecting by \"not the newest run\" cannot, in any ordering."
msgstr "`KEEP_NEWEST_PER` To je to, čo robí záložný bezpečne proti pretekom: hlava SHA z udalosti užitočného ide zastaviť, zatiaľ čo práca čaká na bežca, a `[skip ci]` alebo `GITHUB_TOKEN` tlačiť pohybuje špičku vetvy bez vytvorenia beh vôbec. Výber \"nie aktuálna hlava\" by potom zrušila najnovší informátor a ušetrila by stale one, alebo by opustila pobočku bez CI vôbec. Výber \"nie je najnovší beh\" v žiadnom poradí."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`KEY` MUST be the owned variable's name."
msgstr "`KEY` Musí to byť meno vlastnenej premennej."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`KIX Start <https://www.kixdesk.com/>`__ is an open-source IT service management and helpdesk platform forked from OTRS. It provides ticket management, configuration management, knowledge base, and reporting for IT service teams."
msgstr "`KIX Start <https://www.kixdesk.com/>`__ je open-source IT služba riadenie a helpdesk platforma videný z OTRS. Poskytuje správu lístkov, riadenie konfigurácie, znalostnú základňu a reporting pre IT servisné tímy."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`Kata Containers <https://katacontainers.io/>`__ is an OCI container runtime that starts each container inside a lightweight virtual machine with its own kernel instead of sharing the host kernel. `gVisor <https://gvisor.dev/>`__ is a second isolating runtime, shipped as the single ``runsc`` binary, that intercepts container syscalls in a userspace kernel and runs without hardware virtualization."
msgstr "`Kata Containers <https://katacontainers.io/>`__ je výstupný čas kontajnera OCI, ktorý spustí každú nádobu vo vnútri ľahkého virtuálneho stroja s vlastným jadrom namiesto zdieľania hostiteľského jadra. `gVisor <https://gvisor.dev/>`__ je druhý izolačný čas, dodávaný ako jediný ``runsc`` binárne, ktoré zachytáva kontajner syscalls v používateľskom jadre a beží bez hardvérovej virtualizácie."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`KeePassXC <https://keepassxc.org/>`__ is a free, open-source, cross-platform password manager that stores credentials in an encrypted local database compatible with the KeePass format."
msgstr "`KeePassXC <https://keepassxc.org/>`__ je zadarmo, open-source, cross-platform heslo manažér, ktorý ukladá osvedčenia v zašifrovanej miestnej databáze kompatibilné s KeePass formáte."

