# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`LDAP_DN_BASE`, user/admin emails, oauth2-proxy `email_domains`, CA identity: all onion, mutually consistent (users `@<NODE_ONION>.onion` pass the oauth2-proxy email filter)"
msgstr "`LDAP_DN_BASE`, užívateľské/admin emaily, oauth2-proxy `email_domains`, identita CA: všetka cibuľa, vzájomne konzistentná (používatelia `@<NODE_ONION>.onion` passes oauth2-proxy email filter)"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`LM Studio <https://lmstudio.ai/>`__ is a runtime for open large language models. Its headless server mode loads models from a local store and answers chat and completion requests over an OpenAI-compatible HTTP API, so prompts and model weights stay on the machine that runs them."
msgstr "`LM Studio <https://lmstudio.ai/>`__ je čas na otvorenie veľkých jazykových modelov. Bezhlavý serverový režim načítava modely z miestneho obchodu a odpovedá na žiadosti o chat a dokončenie cez OpenAI kompatibilnú HTTP API, takže podnety a modelové závažia zostávajú na stroji, ktorý ich prevádzkuje."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`Laya <https://laya.aay.sh/>`__ is a local-first notification command center that aggregates Slack, mail, issue trackers and calendars into approvable action cards."
msgstr "`Laya <https://laya.aay.sh/>`__ je miestne, prvé centrum hlásenia, ktoré zoskupuje Slack, poštu, vystavuje sledovače a kalendáre do výhodných akčných kariet."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`Lint and syntax checks` catch style, formatting, and Ansible syntax problems early."
msgstr "`Lint and syntax checks` chytiť štýl, formátovanie, a Ansible syntax problémy čoskoro."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`LiteLLM <https://docs.litellm.ai/>`__ is an LLM gateway that exposes an OpenAI-compatible HTTP API and forwards each request to a configured model backend, local or hosted. Clients authenticate with virtual API keys that the gateway issues and stores in its own database."
msgstr "`LiteLLM <https://docs.litellm.ai/>`__ je vstupná brána LLM, ktorá odhaľuje HTTP kompatibilnú s OpenAI API a zasiela každú požiadavku na nakonfigurovaný model backend, miestny alebo hostovaný. Klienti autentifikujú s virtuálnym API kľúče, ktoré brána problémy a ukladá vo svojej vlastnej databáze."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`LiteLLM <https://docs.litellm.ai/>`__ is an LLM gateway that puts a single OpenAI-compatible API in front of many model providers. Its admin UI is the gateway’s built-in web interface for virtual API keys, teams, budgets and rate limits, model routing, and request and spend logs."
msgstr "`LiteLLM <https://docs.litellm.ai/>`__ je LLM brána, ktorá dáva jednu OpenAI-kompatibilný API pred mnohými poskytovateľmi modelov. Jeho admin UI je bránou vstavané webové rozhranie pre virtuálne API kľúče, tímy, rozpočty a úrokové limity, model trasy, a požiadať a minúť denníky."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`Local deploy and E2E validation` checks whether apps and deployment flows work in a realistic local stack."
msgstr "`Local deploy and E2E validation` kontroluje, či aplikácie a toky zavádzania fungujú v reálnom lokálnom zásobníku."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`MODE_CLEANUP`: Removes unused Docker containers, networks, images, and volumes."
msgstr "`MODE_CLEANUP`: Odstráni nepoužité Docker kontajnery, siete, obrázky, a zväzky."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`MODE_RESET`: Performs cleanup and restarts the Docker service."
msgstr "`MODE_RESET`: Vykonáva čistenie a reštartuje Docker službu."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`Mailu <https://mailu.io/>`__ as a full-featured mail server (when available),"
msgstr "`Mailu <https://mailu.io/>`__ ako full-featured mail server (ak je k dispozícii),"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`MaxDirectMemorySize`. Mirrors `INFINITO_CACHE_PACKAGE_HEAP`."
msgstr "`MaxDirectMemorySize`. Zrkadlá `INFINITO_CACHE_PACKAGE_HEAP`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`MemAvailable` from /proc/meminfo in MB. 0 on failure."
msgstr "`MemAvailable` z /proc/meminfo v MB. 0 pri zlyhaní."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`MemTotal` from /proc/meminfo in MB. 0 on failure."
msgstr "`MemTotal` z /proc/meminfo v MB. 0 pri zlyhaní."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`Metadata`: **Read** (default, cannot be removed)."
msgstr "`Metadata`: **Čítanie** (predvolené, nemožno odstrániť)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`NFS <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Network_File_System>`__ (Network File System) is a kernel-level protocol for sharing files over a network. The server exports a directory tree under defined access rules; clients mount it as if it were a local filesystem."
msgstr "`NFS <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Network_File_System>`__ (Systém sieťových súborov) je protokol na úrovni jadra pre zdieľanie súborov cez sieť. Server exportuje adresárový strom podľa definovaných pravidiel prístupu; klienti ho pripájajú, akoby to bol lokálny súborový systém."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`NFS <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Network_File_System>`__ (Network File System) lets a host mount a directory exported by a remote server as if it were a local filesystem. The client packages provide the kernel helpers and userspace tools to perform that mount."
msgstr "`NFS <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Network_File_System>`__ (Systém sieťových súborov) umožňuje hostiteľovi pripojiť adresár exportovaný vzdialeným serverom, akoby to bol lokálny súborový systém. Klientske balíky poskytujú pomocníkom jadra a užívateľským nástrojom na vykonanie tohto pripojenia."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`N` → route a share of deploy jobs to your `[self-hosted, linux]` runners."
msgstr "`N` → smerovať podiel nasadenie pracovných miest do `[self-hosted, linux]` Bežci."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`Nexus Repository <https://www.sonatype.com/products/sonatype-nexus-repository>`__ is a repository manager that proxies package registries and serves an artefact it has already fetched from local disk. `nginx <https://nginx.org/>`__ sits in front of it and answers for the upstream hostnames themselves, so a package manager keeps the URLs it was built with and still reads through the proxy."
msgstr "`Nexus Repository <https://www.sonatype.com/products/sonatype-nexus-repository>`__ je správca úložiska, ktorý zastupuje registre balíkov a slúži artefaktu, ktorý už priniesol z lokálneho disku. `nginx <https://nginx.org/>`__ Sedí pred ním a odpovede pre hostnames proti prúdu sami, takže správca balíka udržuje URL, s ktorými bol postavený a stále číta cez proxy."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`Nginx <https://nginx.org/>`__ is a high-performance web server and reverse proxy. This role wraps Nginx as a first-party mirror for the third-party assets other web applications declare in their CSP whitelists, so browsers fetch those assets from the deployment itself instead of contacting external hosts."
msgstr "`Nginx <https://nginx.org/>`__ je vysoko výkonný webový server a spätný proxy. Táto úloha zabalí Nginx ako zrkadlo prvej strany pre aktíva tretích strán ostatné webové aplikácie deklarujú vo svojich CSP whitelists, takže prehliadače získať tieto aktíva zo samotného nasadenia namiesto kontaktovania externých hostiteľov."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`Nginx <https://nginx.org/>`__ is a high-performance web server and reverse proxy. This role wraps Nginx as an internal Content Delivery Network that serves static assets such as CSS and JavaScript bundles for other web applications in the stack."
msgstr "`Nginx <https://nginx.org/>`__ je vysoko výkonný webový server a spätný proxy. Táto rola zabalí Nginx ako interný Content Delivery Network ktorý slúži statickým aktívam, ako sú CSS a JavaScript zväzky pre iné webové aplikácie v zásobníku."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`OBS Studio <https://obsproject.com/>`__ is a free, open-source application for video recording and live streaming, widely used for screencasts, broadcasting, and content creation."
msgstr "`OBS Studio <https://obsproject.com/>`__ je bezplatná, open-source aplikácia pre video nahrávanie a živé streamovanie, široko používaná pre screenscasts, vysielanie a tvorbu obsahu."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`OIDC.ATTRIBUTES.USERNAME` and `LDAP.USER.ATTRIBUTES.ID` are paired on purpose. They MUST resolve to the same logical user on both sides so that an account created in OpenLDAP can sign in through Keycloak without an extra mapping step. Changing one without the other breaks LDAP-OIDC correlation."
msgstr "`OIDC.ATTRIBUTES.USERNAME` a `LDAP.USER.ATTRIBUTES.ID` sú naschvál párované. MUSÍ vyriešiť rovnaké logické užívateľa na oboch stranách tak, že účet vytvorený v OpenLDAP môže podpísať Keycloak bez ďalšieho mapovania. Zmena jedného bez druhého zlomí koreláciu LDAP-OIDC."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`OIDC.ATTRIBUTES` lists the claim names that downstream applications read out of the userinfo response and ID token:"
msgstr "`OIDC.ATTRIBUTES` uvádza názvy tvrdení, ktoré nadväzujúce aplikácie čítajú z odpovede používateľainfo a identifikačného tokenu:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`Ollama <https://ollama.com>`__ is a local model server that runs open LLMs on your hardware and exposes a simple HTTP API. Prompts and data stay on your machines, making it the backbone for privacy-first AI."
msgstr "`Ollama <https://ollama.com>`__ je lokálny model server, ktorý beží otvorené LLM na vašom hardvéri a odhaľuje jednoduchý HTTP API. Výzvy a dáta zostať na svojich strojoch, čo je chrbtica pre súkromie-prvé UI."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`Open PR if … changed` step"
msgstr "`Open PR if … changed` krok"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`OpenBao <https://openbao.org/>`__ is an identity-based secrets and encryption manager governed by the Linux Foundation. It stores application credentials, API keys, service and database credentials, automation and agent identities, short-lived tokens and encryption keys behind a policy engine, and can act as an internal certificate authority."
msgstr "`OpenBao <https://openbao.org/>`__ je správca šifrovania založený na identite, ktorý riadi Nadáciu Linux. Ukladá si prihlasovacie údaje, API kľúče, servisné a databázové údaje, automatizácia a identita agenta, krátkodobé žetóny a šifrovacie kľúče za politickým motorom a môžu pôsobiť ako interný certifikačný orgán."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`OpenClaw <https://openclaw.ai/>`__ is an open-source personal AI agent that runs on hardware you control. It ships a gateway process with a browser Control UI next to its CLI and TUI, keeps persistent memory and a workspace on disk, and performs browser and filesystem tasks inside its own sandbox."
msgstr "`OpenClaw <https://openclaw.ai/>`__ je open-source osobný agent AI, ktorý beží na hardvéru, ktorý ovládate. Vysiela proces brány s prehliadačom riadenie UI vedľa jeho CLI a TUI, udržuje trvalú pamäť a pracovné miesto na disku, a vykonáva úlohy prehliadača a súborového systému vo svojom vlastnom pieskovisku."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`OpenCloud <https://opencloud.eu/>`__ is a sovereign self-hosted file sync, share, and collaboration platform maintained by the Heinlein Group. It is a fork of the OpenCloud Infinite Scale codebase and is published as the ``opencloudeu/opencloud`` container image."
msgstr "`OpenCloud <https://opencloud.eu/>`__ je suverénny self-hosted súbor synchronizácia, zdieľať, a spolupráca platforma udržiavaná Heinlein Group. Je to vidlička OpenCloud Infinite Scale codebase a je zverejnený ako ``opencloudeu/opencloud`` obraz kontajnera."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`OpenTalk <https://opentalk.eu/>`__ is a sovereign open-source video conferencing platform developed by the Heinlein Group. It combines a Rust controller, a LiveKit-based WebRTC media server, and a React web frontend."
msgstr "`OpenTalk <https://opentalk.eu/>`__ je suverénna open-source videokonferenčná platforma vyvinutá skupinou Heinlein Group. To kombinuje Rust regulátor, LiveKit-based WebRTC mediálny server, a React web frontend."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=true` : Social Home 2026.6.16 imports `logout` from `client/src/store/auth.ts` in exactly one place —   `client/src/main.tsx` wires it as the 401 handler via `setUnauthorizedHandler(logout)`. No   component renders a logout control, so `personas/utils/logout.js` has nothing to click and the   admin journey cannot complete. The alternative — injecting a `[data-injected-logout]` button via   `templates/javascript.js.j2` — was rejected: the model   (`roles/web-app-prometheus/templates/javascript.js.j2`) points the button at   `OIDC.CLIENT.LOGOUT_URL`, which only exists for OIDC-gated roles, and this role deliberately runs   without SSO. Path back: upstream ships a logout control (or an in-app logout endpoint we can   target), then drop the flag and keep the `adminInteraction` already wired in the spec."
msgstr "`PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=true` : Sociálny domov 2026.6.16 dovoz `logout` od `client/src/store/auth.ts` na presne jednom mieste `client/src/main.tsx` drôty ako 401 Manipulátor cez `setUnauthorizedHandler(logout)`. Žiaden komponent nevytvára ovládanie odhlásenia, takže `personas/utils/logout.js` nemá čo kliknúť a admin cesta nemôže dokončiť. Alternatíva `[data-injected-logout]` • `templates/javascript.js.j2` (`roles/web-app-prometheus/templates/javascript.js.j2`) ukazuje tlačidlo na `OIDC.CLIENT.LOGOUT_URL`, ktorý existuje len pre úlohy OIDC-u, a táto úloha zámerne funguje bez SSO. Cesta späť: lode proti prúdu ovládanie odhlásenia (alebo odhlásený koncový bod v aplikácii môžeme zacieliť), potom spustiť vlajku a udržať `adminInteraction` Už je zapojená do špecifikácie."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=true` is declared because the shared helper cannot reach Shopware's logout, not because the journey is untestable. The only logout control lives in `.sw-admin-menu__user-actions`, which the administration stylesheet keeps at `display: none` until its toggle is clicked, and that toggle is a bare `div` carrying no role, no `aria-haspopup` and no dropdown class — nothing in the helper's trigger set matches it. Its second fallback, following a same-origin settings link, misses as well because the administration is hash-routed and every settings target is `#/sw/settings/...`."
msgstr "`PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=true` je deklarovaná, pretože zdieľaný pomocník nemôže dosiahnuť Shopware's logout, nie preto, že cesta je netestovateľná. Jediné odhlásenie kontroly žije v `.sw-admin-menu__user-actions`, na ktorej sa udržiava štýl správy `display: none` Kým sa klikne jeho toggle, a že toggle je holý `div` bez úlohy, nie `aria-haspopup` a žiadne dropdown triedy Jeho druhý pád, po rovnako-pôvod nastavení odkaz, chýba, rovnako preto, že správa je hash-smerovaný a každé nastavenie cieľ je `#/sw/settings/...`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=true` is declared for a second, independent reason, and two separate obstacles justify it."
msgstr "`PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=true` je deklarovaná z druhého nezávislého dôvodu a odôvodňujú to dve samostatné prekážky."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true` : The app authenticates against its own `platform_users` table. There is no OIDC client and no   auto-provisioning, so the biber account never exists inside Social Home. Path back: upstream   grows an OIDC/trusted-header auth path."
msgstr "`PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true` : Autentické proti svojej vlastnej `platform_users` stôl. Neexistuje žiadny klient OIDC a žiadne automatické poskytovanie, takže biblický účet nikdy neexistuje vnútri Social Home. Cesta späť: proti prúdu rastie OIDC / dôveryhodná-hlava auth cesta."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`POST auth/approle/role/<name>/role-id` accepts a caller-supplied `role_id` (`logical.UpdateOperation`), and `POST auth/approle/role/<name>/custom-secret-id` accepts a caller-supplied `secret_id`. Both verified in [`path_role.go`](https://github.com/openbao/openbao/blob/main/internal/builtin/credential/approle/path_role.go) (lines 889 and 1243)."
msgstr "`POST auth/approle/role/<name>/role-id` akceptuje ponuku volajúceho `role_id` (`logical.UpdateOperation`), a `POST auth/approle/role/<name>/custom-secret-id` akceptuje ponuku volajúceho `secret_id`. Obaja overené v [`path_role.go`](https://github.com/openbao/openbao/blob/main/internal/builtin/credential/approle/path_role.go) (riadky 889 a 1243)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`PROJECT_ROOT` is the repo root derived from this file's location."
msgstr "`PROJECT_ROOT` je repo koreň odvodený z umiestnenia tohto súboru."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`Pi <https://github.com/earendil-works/pi>`__ is a minimal terminal coding agent with a lazy-loading skill system. This role installs it on a workstation and registers the platform’s model gateway as its provider."
msgstr "`Pi <https://github.com/earendil-works/pi>`__ je minimálny kódovací prostriedok terminálu so systémom lenivých schopností. Táto úloha ho nainštaluje na pracovnú stanicu a registruje modelovú bránu platformy ako svojho poskytovateľa."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`Prometheus <https://prometheus.io/>`__ is an open-source systems monitoring and alerting toolkit that collects and stores time-series metrics and provides a powerful query language (PromQL)."
msgstr "`Prometheus <https://prometheus.io/>`__ je súbor nástrojov na monitorovanie a upozornenie systémov s otvoreným zdrojovým kódom, ktorý zhromažďuje a ukladá metriku časových radov a poskytuje silný jazyk dotazu (PromQL)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`Pull requests`: **Read and write** (`gh pr create` / `gh pr edit`)."
msgstr "`Pull requests`: **Čítať a písať** (`gh pr create` / `gh pr edit`)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`README.md` files MAY exist under `scripts/` as documentation-only exceptions."
msgstr "`README.md` súbory MÔŽE existovať pod `scripts/` ako výnimky z dokumentácie."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`README.md` files MAY exist under `utils/` as documentation-only exceptions."
msgstr "`README.md` súbory MÔŽE existovať pod `utils/` ako výnimky z dokumentácie."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`RUN apk add` (Alpine ≥3.18 HTTPS)"
msgstr "`RUN apk add` (Alpine ≥3.18 HTTPS)"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`RUN apk add` (inner Dockerfile build, Alpine ≤3.17 HTTP)"
msgstr "`RUN apk add` (vnútorné dockersúbore, alpské ≤3.17 HTTP)"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`RUN apt-get install` (inner Dockerfile build, Debian/Ubuntu)"
msgstr "`RUN apt-get install` (iner Dockerfile build, Debian/Ubuntu)"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`RUN pip/npm/gem/composer/go install` (inner Dockerfile build)"
msgstr "`RUN pip/npm/gem/composer/go install` (vnútorné dockerfile build)"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`RUNNER_COUNT` defaults to `RESOURCE_HOST_CPUS // RUNNER_CPUS` (auto-scaled to hardware). Override explicitly when debugging a specific count."
msgstr "`RUNNER_COUNT` štandardné `RESOURCE_HOST_CPUS // RUNNER_CPUS` (auto-scale na hardvér). Prepísať explicitne pri ladení konkrétneho počtu."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`RUNNER_DISTRIBUTION` is **required** and has no default; it is passed automatically by the CLI."
msgstr "`RUNNER_DISTRIBUTION` ci **požadované** a nemá predvolenú hodnotu; automaticky ho prechádza CLI."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`RUNNER_GITHUB_OWNER` and `RUNNER_GITHUB_REPO` resolve from `GITHUB_REPOSITORY_OWNER` / `GITHUB_REPOSITORY` env vars when set (CI context), falling back to `meta/services.yml` for production deploys."
msgstr "`RUNNER_GITHUB_OWNER` a `RUNNER_GITHUB_REPO` vyriešiť `GITHUB_REPOSITORY_OWNER` / `GITHUB_REPOSITORY` env vars pri set (Kontext CI), návrat do `meta/services.yml` pre rozmiestnenie výroby."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`RUNTIME` (`dev`/`act`/`github`) selects which test stages run."
msgstr "`RUNTIME` (`dev`/`act`/`github`) vyberie, ktoré skúšobné fázy prebiehajú."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`RetroArch <https://www.retroarch.com/>`__ is a frontend for emulators, game engines, and media players powered by the `Libretro <https://www.libretro.com/>`__ framework. It supports multiple UI styles including `XMB <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/XrossMediaBar>`__ and `Ozone <https://docs.libretro.com/>`__, and provides a unified interface for retro gaming across platforms."
msgstr "`RetroArch <https://www.retroarch.com/>`__ je frontend pre emulátory, herné motory, a mediálne prehrávače poháňané `Libretro <https://www.libretro.com/>`__ rámec. Podporuje viaceré UI štýly vrátane `XMB <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/XrossMediaBar>`__ a `Ozone <https://docs.libretro.com/>`__, a poskytuje jednotné rozhranie pre retro hry cez platformy."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`Roulette Wheel <https://github.com/p-wojt/roulette-wheel>`__ is a Node.js-based front-end application that simulates a roulette wheel in the browser."
msgstr "`Roulette Wheel <https://github.com/p-wojt/roulette-wheel>`__ rá Node.js-na báze front-end aplikácie, ktorá simuluje ruleta koleso v prehliadači."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`SEMAPHORE_ACCESS_KEY_ENCRYPTION` (base64 32 bytes, `head -c32 /dev/urandom | base64`) encrypts stored access keys; `SEMAPHORE_COOKIE_HASH` / `SEMAPHORE_COOKIE_ENCRYPTION` secure sessions."
msgstr "`SEMAPHORE_ACCESS_KEY_ENCRYPTION` (základ64 32 bajty, `head -c32 /dev/urandom | base64`) šifrova uložené prístupové kľúče; `SEMAPHORE_COOKIE_HASH` / `SEMAPHORE_COOKIE_ENCRYPTION` Bezpečné sedenie."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`SEMAPHORE_ADMIN`, `SEMAPHORE_ADMIN_PASSWORD`, `SEMAPHORE_ADMIN_NAME`, `SEMAPHORE_ADMIN_EMAIL` seed the first admin (no setup wizard)."
msgstr "`SEMAPHORE_ADMIN`, `SEMAPHORE_ADMIN_PASSWORD`, `SEMAPHORE_ADMIN_NAME`, `SEMAPHORE_ADMIN_EMAIL` semeno prvý admin (žiadny sprievodca nastavením)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`SEMAPHORE_DB_DIALECT` ∈ `bolt` (file at `/var/lib/semaphore`), `mysql`, `postgres`. Postgres uses `SEMAPHORE_DB_HOST/PORT/USER/PASS/SEMAPHORE_DB`."
msgstr "`SEMAPHORE_DB_DIALECT` `bolt` (súbor v `/var/lib/semaphore`), `mysql`, `postgres`. Použitie postgresu `SEMAPHORE_DB_HOST/PORT/USER/PASS/SEMAPHORE_DB`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`SEMAPHORE_LDAP_ACTIVATED`, `SEMAPHORE_LDAP_HOST`, `SEMAPHORE_LDAP_PORT`, `SEMAPHORE_LDAP_NEEDTLS`, `SEMAPHORE_LDAP_DN_BIND`, `SEMAPHORE_LDAP_PASSWORD`, `SEMAPHORE_LDAP_DN_SEARCH`, `SEMAPHORE_LDAP_SEARCH_FILTER`, plus attribute mappings (`SEMAPHORE_LDAP_MAPPING_DN/UID/MAIL/CN`)."
msgstr "`SEMAPHORE_LDAP_ACTIVATED`, `SEMAPHORE_LDAP_HOST`, `SEMAPHORE_LDAP_PORT`, `SEMAPHORE_LDAP_NEEDTLS`, `SEMAPHORE_LDAP_DN_BIND`, `SEMAPHORE_LDAP_PASSWORD`, `SEMAPHORE_LDAP_DN_SEARCH`, `SEMAPHORE_LDAP_SEARCH_FILTER`, plus mapovanie atribútov (`SEMAPHORE_LDAP_MAPPING_DN/UID/MAIL/CN`)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`SEMAPHORE_OIDC_PROVIDERS` = JSON map. Per-provider: `display_name`, `provider_url` (issuer), `client_id`, `client_secret`, `redirect_url`. Redirect path is `https://<host>/api/auth/oidc/<provider_id>/redirect`. **Semaphore has native OIDC — no `oauth2-proxy` sidecar needed.**"
msgstr "`SEMAPHORE_OIDC_PROVIDERS` = mapa JSON. Na poskytovateľa: `display_name`, `provider_url` (emitent), `client_id`, `client_secret`, `redirect_url`. Redirect cesta je `https://<host>/api/auth/oidc/<provider_id>/redirect`. **Semaphore má natívne OIDC `oauth2-proxy` Sidecar potreboval.**"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`SEMAPHORE_WEB_ROOT` sets the externally-reachable base URL; required for correct OIDC redirects behind `sys-svc-proxy`."
msgstr "`SEMAPHORE_WEB_ROOT` nastaví externe dostupné základné URL; požadované pre správne presmerovanie OIDC `sys-svc-proxy`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`SH_APPS_CATALOG_URL` is emptied so the container never fetches the app catalog from github.com. Set it to a self-hosted catalog when one exists."
msgstr "`SH_APPS_CATALOG_URL` je vyprázdnený, takže kontajner nikdy nestiahne katalóg aplikácií z github.com. Nastavte ho do katalógu s vlastným hostom, ak existuje."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`SH_CORS_ALLOWED_ORIGINS` is unset — the SPA is same-origin. Needed only if a third-party client should talk to the API."
msgstr "`SH_CORS_ALLOWED_ORIGINS` je odstavená Potrebné len v prípade, že tretia strana klient by mal hovoriť s API."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`SH_MAX_STORAGE_BYTES` is pinned to 4 GiB in `vars/main.yml` so the app's media cap stays inside `services.socialhome.min_storage` (5 GB). Raising one without the other lets the volume outgrow its declared budget."
msgstr "`SH_MAX_STORAGE_BYTES` je pripnutý na 4 GiB in `vars/main.yml` Takže mediálna čiapka aplikácie zostane vnútri `services.socialhome.min_storage` (5 GB). Vychovávať jeden bez druhého umožňuje objem vyrastie svoj deklarovaný rozpočet."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`SSH (Secure Shell) <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Secure_Shell>`__ is a cryptographic network protocol for operating network services securely over an unsecured network. The `OpenSSH <https://www.openssh.com/>`__ project provides the reference implementation, including ``ssh-agent`` for managing authentication keys."
msgstr "`SSH (Secure Shell) <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Secure_Shell>`__ je kryptografický sieťový protokol pre prevádzku sieťových služieb bezpečne cez nezabezpečenú sieť. EÚ `OpenSSH <https://www.openssh.com/>`__ projekt zabezpečuje referenčné vykonávanie vrátane ``ssh-agent`` pre správu autentifikačných kľúčov."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`SYS_SERVICE_RUNNER_STATE` (string): desired state (`started`, `restarted`, ...)"
msgstr "`SYS_SERVICE_RUNNER_STATE` (reťazec): želaný stav (`started`, `restarted`, ...)"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`SearXNG <https://docs.searxng.org/>`__ is a metasearch engine. It forwards a query to other search engines and returns the merged result without an account and without a tracking profile."
msgstr "`SearXNG <https://docs.searxng.org/>`__ je metasearchový motor. Zasiela otázku iným vyhľadávačom a vracia zlúčený výsledok bez účtu a bez sledovacieho profilu."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`SeaweedFS <https://github.com/seaweedfs/seaweedfs>`__ is a fast distributed storage system for blobs, objects, and files. It exposes an S3-compatible API, so applications store and retrieve objects with standard S3 SDKs and CLIs."
msgstr "`SeaweedFS <https://github.com/seaweedfs/seaweedfs>`__ je rýchlo distribuovaný úložný systém pre guličky, objekty a súbory. Odhaľuje S3- kompatibilný API, takže aplikácie ukladať a získavať objekty s štandardom S3 SDK a CLIS."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`Semaphore UI <https://semaphoreui.com/>`__ is a modern web UI and API for running Ansible playbooks, Terraform/OpenTofu plans, and shell scripts on a schedule or on demand. This role deploys the official ```semaphoreui/semaphore`` <https://github.com/semaphoreui/semaphore>`__ container behind the Infinito.Nexus reverse proxy with central PostgreSQL, native Keycloak OIDC Single Sign-On, and optional LDAP login."
msgstr "`Semaphore UI <https://semaphoreui.com/>`__ je moderné webové UI a API pre spustenie Ansible playbooks, Terraform/OpenTofu plány, a shell skripty na rozvrh alebo na požiadanie. Táto úloha rozmiestňuje úradníka ```semaphoreui/semaphore`` <https://github.com/semaphoreui/semaphore>` kontajner za Infinito.Nexus reverzný proxy s centrálnym PostgreSQL, rodák Keycloak OIDC Single Sign-On a voliteľné LDAP login."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`Svc Engine <https://example.com/>`__ is an application."
msgstr "`Svc Engine <https://example.com/>`__ je žiadosť."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`Svc Objstore <https://example.com/>`__ is an application."
msgstr "`Svc Objstore <https://example.com/>`__ je žiadosť."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`TEST_E2E_PLAYWRIGHT_COMMAND` (default: `npm install --no-fund --no-audit && npx playwright test`)"
msgstr "`TEST_E2E_PLAYWRIGHT_COMMAND` (predvolené: `npm install --no-fund --no-audit && npx playwright test`)"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`TEST_E2E_PLAYWRIGHT_IMAGE_DISTRO` (default: `noble`)"
msgstr "`TEST_E2E_PLAYWRIGHT_IMAGE_DISTRO` (predvolené: `noble`)"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`TEST_E2E_PLAYWRIGHT_IMAGE` (resolved in `vars/main.yml` from `meta/services.yml.playwright.image` + `.version` via `lookup('config', 'test-e2e-playwright', 'services.playwright.image|version')`)"
msgstr "`TEST_E2E_PLAYWRIGHT_IMAGE` (v `vars/main.yml` od `meta/services.yml.playwright.image` + `.version` via `lookup('config', 'test-e2e-playwright', 'services.playwright.image|version')`)"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`TEST_E2E_PLAYWRIGHT_REPORTS_BASE_DIR` (default: `/var/lib/infinito/logs/test-e2e-playwright`)"
msgstr "`TEST_E2E_PLAYWRIGHT_REPORTS_BASE_DIR` (predvolené: `/var/lib/infinito/logs/test-e2e-playwright`)"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`TEST_E2E_PLAYWRIGHT_STAGE_BASE_DIR` (default: `/tmp/test-e2e-playwright`)"
msgstr "`TEST_E2E_PLAYWRIGHT_STAGE_BASE_DIR` (predvolené: `/tmp/test-e2e-playwright`)"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`Taiga <https://www.taiga.io/>`__ is a powerful and intuitive open-source project management platform tailored for agile teams. Whether you’re practicing Scrum, Kanban, or a custom hybrid workflow, Taiga offers a rich, customizable environment to plan, track, and collaborate on your projects, without the complexity of enterprise tools or the vendor lock-in of SaaS platforms."
msgstr "`Taiga <https://www.taiga.io/>`__ je výkonná a intuitívna platforma riadenia open-source projektov na mieru pre agilné tímy. Či už cvičíte Scrum, Kanban, alebo vlastné hybridné pracovné postupy, Taiga ponúka bohaté, prispôsobiteľné prostredie na plánovanie, sledovanie a spoluprácu na vašich projektoch, bez zložitosti podnikových nástrojov alebo dodávateľa lock-in platforiem SaaS."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`Test E2E Cli <https://example.com/>`__ is an application."
msgstr "`Test E2E Cli <https://example.com/>`__ je žiadosť."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`ToolServerConnection.auth_type: system_oauth` resolves the caller's token through `oauth_manager.get_oauth_token(user.id, oauth_session_id)` and presents it as the Bearer"
msgstr "`ToolServerConnection.auth_type: system_oauth` vyrieši signál volajúceho cez `oauth_manager.get_oauth_token(user.id, oauth_session_id)` a predstavuje ju ako Nositeľa"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`Unit tests` verify isolated logic."
msgstr "`Unit tests` overiť izolovanú logiku."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`UsersLookup` yields the `no-reply` user dict used to derive `from` and `password`. Missing entries MUST yield an empty dict. The fallback for `from` is then `root@<inventory_hostname>.localdomain`."
msgstr "`UsersLookup` vypláca `no-reply` @ info: tooltip `from` a `password`. Chýbajúce záznamy musia byť prázdne. Úpadok pre `from` je potom `root@<inventory_hostname>.localdomain`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`Visual Studio Code <https://code.visualstudio.com/>`__ is a powerful source code editor with a wide plugin ecosystem, supporting development workflows across many languages and platforms. See also the `Arch Wiki - Development Tools <https://wiki.archlinux.org/title/Category:Development>`__ and general `Software Engineering <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Software_engineering>`__ on Wikipedia."
msgstr "`Visual Studio Code <https://code.visualstudio.com/>`__ je výkonný editor zdrojového kódu so širokým pluginovým ekosystémom, ktorý podporuje vývojové pracovné postupy v mnohých jazykoch a platformách. Pozri tiež `Arch Wiki - Development Tools <https://wiki.archlinux.org/title/Category:Development>`__ a všeobecné `Software Engineering <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Software_engineering>`__ na Wikipédii."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`Visual Studio Code <https://github.com/microsoft/vscode>`__ in a selectable flavor: the distribution’s Code - OSS build, VSCodium, or Microsoft’s own binary."
msgstr "`Visual Studio Code <https://github.com/microsoft/vscode>`__ vo vybranej chuti: distribúcia Code - OSS build, VSCodium, alebo Microsoft."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`WordPress <https://en.wordpress.org/>`__ is a versatile and widely used `content management system (CMS) <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Content_management_system>`__ that powers millions of websites, from blogs and portfolios to e-commerce and corporate sites. This deployment provides a containerized WordPress instance optimized for multisite operation, advanced media management, and extensive plugin support, allowing you to fully leverage the rich features of the WordPress software."
msgstr "`WordPress <https://en.wordpress.org/>`__ je univerzálny a široko používaný `content management system (CMS) <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Content_management_system>`__ ktoré poháňajú milióny webových stránok, od blogov a portfólií po e-commerce a firemné stránky. Toto nasadenie poskytuje kontajnerové WordPress napríklad optimalizovaný pre multisite prevádzku, pokročilé riadenie médií, a rozsiahlu podporu plugin, čo vám umožní plne využiť bohaté funkcie WordPress softvér."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`Zammad <https://zammad.org/>`__ is an open-source helpdesk and ticketing system. Agents handle customer requests across email, chat, phone and web; customers can open tickets from a self-service portal."
msgstr "`Zammad <https://zammad.org/>`__ je open-source helpdesk a systém predaja lístkov. Agenti spracovávajú požiadavky zákazníkov cez e-mail, chat, telefón a web; zákazníci môžu otvoriť vstupenky z samoobslužného portálu."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`Zoom <https://zoom.us/>`__ is a popular video conferencing application for online meetings, webinars, and collaboration."
msgstr "`Zoom <https://zoom.us/>`__ je populárna videokonferenčná aplikácia pre online stretnutia, webináre a spoluprácu."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`[user@]host:/dev/...` → a device on the host, recovered over ssh then pulled; `[user@]host:/image` → the image is pulled and recovered locally (`device` / `full`)"
msgstr "`[user@]host:/dev/...` → zariadenie na hostiteľa, zotavené cez ssh potom vytiahol; `[user@]host:/image` → obraz je vytiahnutý a obnovený lokálne (`device` / `full`)"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`_as_bool` MUST accept the usual string forms (`true|false|yes|no|1|0|on|off`), booleans, and numbers. Every boolean decision in the fallbacks MUST use it so that `SYSTEM_EMAIL_*` values coming from YAML, environment variables, or already-coerced facts all behave the same."
msgstr "`_as_bool` MUSÍ akceptovať zvyčajné formuláre reťazcov (`true|false|yes|no|1|0|on|off`), Booleans a čísla. Každé boolean rozhodnutie v záložných musí použiť tak, aby `SYSTEM_EMAIL_*` hodnoty pochádzajúce z YAML, environmentálne premenné, alebo už-coerced fakty všetky správajú rovnako."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`_compute` MUST delegate to three other lookup plugins rather than re-reading project state directly:"
msgstr "`_compute` MUSÍ preniesť na tri ďalšie vyhľadávacie moduly namiesto toho, aby re-čítanie projektu stav priamo:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`_shared.js` — env + login helpers (`penpotOidcLogin`, `penpotLdapLogin`, `penpotNativeLogin`, `penpotRegister`)."
msgstr "`_shared.js` (`penpotOidcLogin`, `penpotLdapLogin`, `penpotNativeLogin`, `penpotRegister`)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "``\"block-above\"``: the construct's own line, or any comment line above it within the same blank-line-delimited block. A gettext entry stacks several comments and repeats a URL in both ``msgid`` and ``msgstr``, so a marker has to cover the whole entry and survive whichever writer appends its comment last."
msgstr "``\"block-above\"``: vlastný riadok konštruktéra alebo akýkoľvek komentár nad ním v rámci rovnakého slepého riadku-obmedzený blok. Name ``msgid`` a ``msgstr``, takže značka musí pokryť celú položku a prežiť, ktorý spisovateľ pripojí svoj komentár posledný."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "``\"line-above\"``: marker must be on the immediately preceding non-empty line. Blank lines between marker and construct break the association."
msgstr "``\"line-above\"``: Značka musí byť na bezprostredne predchádzajúcej neprázdnej čiare. Prázdne čiary medzi fixkou a konštrukciou prelomia spojenie."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "``\"same-line\"``: marker must be on the construct's line."
msgstr "``\"same-line\"``: značka musí byť na konštrukčnej čiare."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "``\"same-or-above\"`` (default): either of the above."
msgstr "``\"same-or-above\"`` (štandardná): niektorý z vyššie uvedených."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "``#`` (Python, YAML, shell, conf, INI, …)"
msgstr "``#`` (Python, YAML, shell, conf, INI, ...)"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "``#``, ``@``, ``+``, ``%`` and ``/`` introduce an axis and appear in neither a role id nor a display name, so the first of them is the seam."
msgstr "``#``, ``@``, ``+``, ``%`` a ``/`` zaviesť os a objaviť ani v úlohe ID ani zobrazovacie meno, takže prvý z nich je šv."

# translated-by: libretranslate
#, python-brace-format
msgid "``$wgAIEditingAssistantActiveProviderConnection`` is the JSON object ``{url, endpoint, model, secret}`` built from ``MEDIAWIKI_LITELLM_CONNECTION``; ``url`` is ``LITELLM_OPENAI_BASE_LOCAL_URL`` and ``secret`` is this role’s own ``credentials.litellm_api_key``. The braces are mandatory: a brace-free value is re-wrapped as ``{\"legacy\": ...}`` upstream and the provider falls back to the vendor endpoint at ``api.openai.com``."
msgstr "``$wgAIEditingAssistantActiveProviderConnection`` je objekt JSON ``{url, endpoint, model, secret}`` postavený z ``MEDIAWIKI_LITELLM_CONNECTION``; ``url`` ci ``LITELLM_OPENAI_BASE_LOCAL_URL`` a ``secret`` je táto úloha je vlastná ``credentials.litellm_api_key``. Traky sú povinné: hodnota bez trakcie sa znovu zabalí ako ``{\"legacy\": ...}`` V počiatočnej fáze a poskytovateľ spadne späť do koncového ukazovateľa dodávateľa ``api.openai.com``."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "``$wgAIEditingAssistantActiveProvider`` is ``open-ai``."
msgstr "``$wgAIEditingAssistantActiveProvider`` ci ``open-ai``."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "``$wgHTTPTimeout`` is raised inside the same block because core’s 25s is below a cold local model’s first token."
msgstr "``$wgHTTPTimeout`` je zvýšený vnútri rovnakého bloku, pretože jadro 25s je pod chladným miestnym modelom a prvý token."

# translated-by: libretranslate
#, no-python-format
msgid "``%%`` is \"contains\" for a scalar string value and \"is a member of\" for a set value; ``==`` / ``!=`` against a set mean membership / non-membership. String comparisons (``==`` ``!=`` ``%%``) are case-insensitive; ``< > <= >=`` are numeric. A bare expression with no operator (e.g. ``nextcloud``) is shorthand for ``name %% nextcloud``."
msgstr "``%%`` ci \"contains\" pre hodnotu reťazca skalára a \"je členom\" pre nastavenú hodnotu; ``==`` / ``!=`` proti súboru znamená členstvo / nečlenstvo. Porovnanie reťazcov (``==`` ``!=`` ``%%``) sú citlivé na prípad; ``< > <= >=`` sú číselné. Holý výraz bez operátora (napr. ``nextcloud``) je skratka pre ``name %% nextcloud``."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "``'on-failure'`` or ``'on-failure:N'`` -> ``'on-failure'``"
msgstr "``'on-failure'`` alebo ``'on-failure:N'`` - > ``'on-failure'``"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "``(\"SKIPPED\", reason)`` when ping is unavailable or lacks CAP_NET_RAW"
msgstr "``(\"SKIPPED\", reason)`` keď ping nie je k dispozícii alebo chýba CAP_NET_RAW"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "``('', '')`` when the role has no instructions to replay or this sweep deploys no variant that could carry them."
msgstr "``('', '')`` keď úloha nemá žiadne pokyny na opakované prehrávanie, alebo táto zametačka nenasadzuje žiadne varianty, ktoré by ich mohli niesť."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "``(1-based line number, text)`` for every line inside a ``## Credits`` section, ending at the next heading of any level."
msgstr "``(1-based line number, text)`` pre každú líniu vnútri ``## Credits`` sekcia, ktorá sa končí pri ďalšom kurze každej úrovne."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "``(None, None)`` when every probe size is dropped"
msgstr "``(None, None)`` pri páde každej veľkosti sondy"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "``(files_glob, dump_glob)`` for the layout *names* describe."
msgstr "``(files_glob, dump_glob)`` pre usporiadanie *mená* opis."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "``(healthcheck, source)`` where source is ``cache``, ``mirror``, ``upstream`` or ``none``. Reading upstream is the documented fallback for images the mirror does not carry; a caller that sweeps many images can use the counts to tell a fallback from a mirror that stopped working."
msgstr "``(healthcheck, source)`` kde je zdroj ``cache``, ``mirror``, ``upstream`` alebo ``none``. Čítanie proti prúdu je zdokumentovaná ložisko pre obrazy, ktoré zrkadlo nenosí; volajúci, ktorý zameta mnoho obrázkov môže použiť počítať povedať pad z zrkadla, ktoré prestalo fungovať."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "``(input name, opening literal, is_marker)`` per rendered segment, in template order."
msgstr "``(input name, opening literal, is_marker)`` za predaný segment v poradí šablóny."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "``(msgctxt, msgid)`` mapped to ``msgstr``; empty and fuzzy entries are left out, so their source text stands in."
msgstr "``(msgctxt, msgid)`` mapovaný na ``msgstr``; prázdne a fuzzy položky sú vynechané, takže ich zdrojový text stojí v."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "``(msgctxt, msgid)`` pairs in source order."
msgstr "``(msgctxt, msgid)`` páry v zdrojovom poradí."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "``(msgctxt, msgid)`` pairs; ``msgctxt`` may be ``None``."
msgstr "``(msgctxt, msgid)`` páry; ``msgctxt`` môže byť ``None``."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "``(name, email)``, unchanged when the mailmap knows the address not."
msgstr "``(name, email)``, nezmenený, ak mailmapa nepozná adresu."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "``(name, email)``; either is empty when neither source knows it."
msgstr "``(name, email)``; buď je prázdny, keď ani jeden zdroj o tom nevie."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "``(payload_bytes, total_bytes)`` on success"
msgstr "``(payload_bytes, total_bytes)`` o úspechu"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "``(role_id, node)`` pairs, manager repositories first."
msgstr "``(role_id, node)`` páry, správca úložiska prvý."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "``(volume, engine)`` for every database volume that carries no dump."
msgstr "``(volume, engine)`` pre každý objem databázy, ktorý nenesie žiadnu skládku."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "``--index`` then prints one chunk as the matrix JSON. Every chunk block runs the same computation and takes its own slice, so the blocks agree without passing state between them."
msgstr "``--index`` potom vytlačí jeden kus ako matrix JSON. Každý kus bloku beží rovnaký výpočet a berie svoj vlastný kúsok, takže bloky sa zhodujú bez toho, aby medzi nimi prechádzali stavom."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "``--matrix`` renders the full ordered candidate list, so the matrix order IS the selection priority. Every human-facing view of that list goes through here rather than re-deriving the sort and the filter: hand-rolling ``--sort \"$INFINITO_DISCOVERY_SORT\" --filter \"compose == true\"`` reads the wrong column (``compose`` is what a role can do, ``test_compose`` is what CI tests), which silently shows an order no run will ever take."
msgstr "``--matrix`` vykresľuje úplný zoznam kandidátov, takže matica poradí IS prioritu výberu. Každý pohľad na tento zoznam smerujúci k človeku prechádza tadiaľto, a nie regeneruje tento druh a filter: ručné valcovanie ``--sort \"$INFINITO_DISCOVERY_SORT\" --filter \"compose == true\"`` číta zlý stĺpec (``compose`` je to, čo môže rola robiť, ``test_compose`` je to, čo testy CI), ktorý ticho ukazuje, že rozkaz žiadny beh nikdy nebude trvať."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "``.mailmap`` maps every address a person has committed under to their ``@infinito.nexus`` address, and that address names their profile: the local part is the profile slug. One social profile is therefore the single point of truth for an author, and nothing here keeps a second copy of their name, URL or avatar."
msgstr "``.mailmap`` mapuje každú adresu, ktorú osoba zaviazala ``@infinito.nexus`` adresa a adresa ich profilu: miestna časť je profil slimák. Jeden sociálny profil je preto jediným bodom pravdy pre autora a nič tu nedrží druhú kópiu ich mena, URL alebo avataru."

