msgid "`ansible` (default)"
msgstr "`ansible` (štandardná)"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`ansible` (default) wraps [matrix-docker-ansible-deploy](https://github.com/spantaleev/matrix-docker-ansible-deploy) (MDAD). MDAD runs ~70 upstream sub-roles to deliver Synapse, Element, every supported bridge, Element Call, and Jitsi. Infinito.Nexus pins MDAD by commit, renders an MDAD inventory from `services.matrix.*` knobs, and disables MDAD's bundled Traefik / Postgres / Redis so the central Infinito services back the stack."
msgstr "`ansible` (štandardná) balenie [rozmiestnenie maticovo-dockerovo-resanlible](https://github.com/spantaleev/matrix-docker-ansible-deploy) (MDAD)MDAD beží ~70 Podúlohy proti prúdu, ktoré dodajú Synapse, Element, každý podporovaný most, Element Call a Jitsi. Infinito.Nexus kolíky MDAD podľa commit, vykresľuje MDAD inventár z `services.matrix.*` gombíky a vypne MDAD zviazané Traefik / Postgres / Redis Takže centrálna Infinito poskytuje späť zásobník."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`api.seaweedfs.s3.*` is the public S3 endpoint and is reachable without SSO gating."
msgstr "`api.seaweedfs.s3.*` je verejnosť S3 koncový ukazovateľ a je dosiahnuteľný bez Bránenia SSO."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`application_id` MUST refer to a role that declares an `rbac:` block in its `meta/services.yml`. The role may be tenant-aware (`rbac.tenancy.axis == \"domain\"`) or not (default)."
msgstr "`application_id` MUSÍ odkazovať na úlohu, ktorá deklaruje `rbac:` blok `meta/services.yml`. Úloha môže byť nájomník-vedomé (`rbac.tenancy.axis == \"domain\"`) alebo nie (štandardná)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`applications['<application_id>'].compose.services.email.<key>`, applied only when an `application_id` is passed."
msgstr "`applications['<application_id>'].compose.services.email.<key>`, uplatňuje sa len vtedy, ak `application_id` prešiel."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`applications['<application_id>'].services.email.<key>`, only when an `application_id` is passed."
msgstr "`applications['<application_id>'].services.email.<key>`, iba ak `application_id` prešiel."

# translated-by: libretranslate
