# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`scripts/meta/wait/mirrors.sh` waits for fork PRs until all required mirror images are available in GHCR before letting the deploy tests proceed. This is necessary because fork PRs cannot push images themselves; the `pull_request_target` event handles that."
msgstr "`scripts/meta/wait/mirrors.sh` čaká na vidlicové PRs, kým všetky požadované zrkadlové snímky sú k dispozícii v GHCR predtým, než necháte rozmiestniť testy pokračovať. Je to potrebné, pretože vidlice PR nemôžu tlačiť obrázky sami; `pull_request_target` O to sa postará."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`scripts/tests/deploy/local/exec/container.sh` is a direct-entry shell script example."
msgstr "`scripts/tests/deploy/local/exec/container.sh` je príklad skriptu s priamym vstupom."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`scripts/tests/deploy/utils/filesystem/resolve.sh` serves a kind only when the **host kernel** carries it: `zfs` needs `/dev/zfs` or a `modinfo zfs` hit, the others need an entry in `/proc/filesystems` or a module. The distro images carry only the userland (`scripts/install/filesystem.sh`)."
msgstr "`scripts/tests/deploy/utils/filesystem/resolve.sh` slúži druhu, len ak **jadro hostiteľa** nesie: `zfs` potreby `/dev/zfs` alebo `modinfo zfs` hit, ostatní potrebujú vstup `/proc/filesystems` alebo modul. Distro obrázky nesú iba užívateľskú krajinu (`scripts/install/filesystem.sh`)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`secrets.credentials.*` paths are populated by `apply_schema()` at `applications.<app>.secrets.credentials.<…>`, so the credential file obeys the same file-root rule as every other `meta/<topic>.yml`."
msgstr "`secrets.credentials.*` cesty sú obsadené `apply_schema()` pri `applications.<app>.secrets.credentials.<…>`, takže vierohodný súbor dodržiava rovnaké pravidlo súboru-root ako každý iný `meta/<topic>.yml`."

