msgid "`update` (optional) controls live upstream monitoring. `update.monitored` defaults to `false`; `update.catalog` MUST name a supported external-test catalog adapter; `update.upstream_id` defaults to `<addon_id>`."
msgstr "`update` (nepovinné) kontroluje monitorovanie naživo. `update.monitored` štandardné `false`; `update.catalog` MUST name a supported external-test katalógový adaptér; `update.upstream_id` štandardné `<addon_id>`."

